  ('zcrm_1579374000168964149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121090002', 'Jeri Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated address on file also directed her to membership changes form in portal as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 10:20:34', '2025-07-30 10:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168973028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115999002', 'Keith Bakos', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in with some questions.  She was originally looking to get Keith off the membership as he is a smoker and she is concerned about the limited sharing.  She asked what kind of process that is, I told her that it would be the same as when she originally enrolled.  She then told me that she would be aging into Medicare in 11/25 and I advised that I could not put her on for only 2 mos.  Shae asked me to send her the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-30 10:14:55', '2025-10-01 12:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168973023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, 'Member called in asking about a few bills that she has that are outstanding.  I advised her of her $5000 IUA and come to find out this is all connected to a knee replacement she had in 11/24.  I advised her that she should be in contact with Zion so that they can advise her how to submit bills to them to process in association with her current need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-30 09:51:04', '2025-07-30 09:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168980001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169685002', 'Rodney Howell', 'Appt. Confirmed for 7/31 at 4:30 PM Pacific (6:30pm  central),', NULL, 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-07-30 09:50:20', '2025-07-30 09:50:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168975098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605002', 'Kirk Schults', NULL, '7/30/25: Kirk called to discuss his upcoming wellness visit and how to not get stuck with a huge lab bill. We discussed options - ended up transferring to ARM so he can discuss if there''s any possible way testosterone would be covered. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 09:23:43', '2025-07-30 09:23:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168975073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137621001', 'Phillip Patterson', NULL, '7/30/25: Teri called asking if her membership would pay for cochlear implants. She''s 100% deaf and in need of an upgrade to her implants which costs about $14,000. According to Zion''s guidelines - DME (durable medical equipment) is eligible however Hearing Aides are not - so it would depend on how it''s categorized. Connected to Zion for a clearer answer. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 08:42:25', '2025-07-30 08:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168975068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, '7/30/25: Called Joy back - she left VM saying she has some questions about an upcoming appt. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 08:10:10', '2025-07-30 08:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168975049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499009', 'Peter Walimire', NULL, '7/30/25: Peter called. He hasn''t used his plan much and needs help logging in - asked for his member ID. His son had an ER visit 5 or so months ago. I walked him through how to open sharing request, provided Zion number (he wanted to call later) and discussed IUA, 6 month deadline etc. Also advised him to download health wallet app, let him know how to log in and what he could do in there. Peter requested new physical cards - put in request in ARM benefit portal for 2 to be sent to new address. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 08:07:34', '2025-07-30 08:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168964077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166868001', 'Gabrielle Passidomo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 07:57:23', '2025-07-30 07:57:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168975038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, '7/30/25: Sent Nancy the following email regarding bills - I need her to acquire an itemized statement from Labcorp to move forward with helping her as well as the bill from Amity Medical Group. 

I got some answers from ARM regarding your medical bills. They’ve received the bill from Tyron Medical Group (the office visit - not lab bill), and it’s currently being processed. At this time, they haven’t received anything from Amity Medical Group, and I didn’t see that one attached here either. If you have a copy, please send it my way.
Regarding the Labcorp bill, the one you attached appears to be a general statement. To move forward with reimbursement, we’ll need an itemized bill that includes the CPT codes. If you’re able to request that from Labcorp, I’d be happy to assist with the next steps once you have it.
------------------------------------------
Nancy responded saying that Labcorp would only mail an itemized bill and she should have it within 7-14 days. She''s asking the same from Amity. 
Let her know I''d reach back out in a couple of weeks to make sure she gets squared away.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-30 07:52:11', '2025-07-30 08:47:31'),
