  ('zcrm_1579374000168958093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157494002', 'Isaiah Taylor', NULL, '7/29/25
Member called because his child requires surgery on his penis.
He wanted to know whether the procedure would be eligible for sharing. I explained that Sedera Guidelines do not explicitly exclude this type of procedure unless it is determined to be cosmetic in nature.

I advised the member to obtain a treatment plan and supporting documentation from the provider that clearly explains why the surgery is medically necessary. This will help in determining eligibility for sharing.AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-29 17:49:17', '2025-07-29 17:49:17'),
