  ('zcrm_1579374000168965006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '7-29-25 Joel''s wife just got  a new job at Valley View Hospital with great benefits. It''s less than $500 for both of them for medical, dental and vision. They even chose to solidify their relationship as common law married after 15 years for Joel to be able to access the benefits. But, he said his MPB membership was the BEST experience he''s ever had. He has always hated insurance and the one time he needed this due to a concussion everything worked as promised and everyone he spoke with was fantastic! He was very pleased and will be back if anything changes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-29 14:58:13', '2025-07-29 14:58:13'),
