  ('zcrm_1579374000168892036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168900002', 'Jeb Dunnuck', NULL, '7-28-25 Jeb 50 and Traci 51 were referred by Kimberly Baldwin. They watched the video and perused the site already. They were well versed. I explained the pre-x clause and let them know cholesterol is no longer exempt. I let them know they will have a pharmacy benefit with the MEC and access to the MPB Concierge Team for pricing out meds. Traci just left as a teacher in the school system. So, their ins runs out July 31st. They can likely play the Cobra game. Cobra is $800 per person, ie. $1600 per month. If not, I told them to call me and I can get them onto C4 for a month. Jeb takes testosterone bc he chooses to. Traci takes meds for cholesterol, blood pressure. She takes HRT for menopause. She is paying and choosing to take semi glutide. Takes ziperol for digestion or acid (I think she said).  Jeb is self employed. They enrolled in Premium HSA on the first call $1500/$655 and $125/$25. They were very nice to talk with and will sign up for the Welcome Call. They will download the Quick Reference Guide as well. They live in East Boulder at 1132 Westview Dr., Boulder, CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-28 15:21:50', '2025-07-28 15:21:50'),
