  ('zcrm_1579374000168814014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104871002', 'Hannah Wilson', NULL, '7-25-25 Hannah is not enrolled in anything right now. Her employer provides a DPC membership for each employee but nothing to protect them for big stuff. She can do her basic wellness with the DPC. The Care+ is the best value for her at age 33. She doesn''t have any pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She moved to Grand Junction since she had joined in the past.  She wants to sit with this and see what she wants to do. We looked at C4 options as well and the lowest cost option starts at $335 and anything that actually gives her benefits is around $400 per month. Her income is about $60K and that puts her on the cusp of an APTC at $1. So, she won''t get a tax credit for 2026 assuming the tax credits lessen. I told her the Aug. 20th deadline for Sept. 1st start date.  Her new zip is 81505.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-25 10:41:02', '2025-07-25 10:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168792114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168815002', 'Denise Bauserman', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-25 10:19:31', '2025-07-25 10:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168814006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104871002', 'Hannah Wilson', NULL, '7-25-25 Hannah wants to enroll again in MCS. We step up a meeting for right now but she didn''t answer. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-25 10:09:26', '2025-07-25 10:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168792106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168804002', 'James Vardas', NULL, 'Member only $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-25 10:08:51', '2025-07-25 10:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168814001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168804002', 'James Vardas', NULL, '7-25-25 James is enrolling in Premium HSA $1000/$336 and $125/$25. He has some past joint issues he was trying to remember and takes aciclovir. He''s all set for Sept. 1st start date. He might need reg ins for new year to address some joint issues and old injuries. His -x wife lost her benefits but can get on Cobra. She''s choosing to keep the kids on with her for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-25 10:04:25', '2025-07-25 10:10:51'),
