  ('zcrm_1579374000168792011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819507', 'Brian Teske', NULL, 'I received notification from Sedera that this member wanted to add a newborn to the membership.  I emailed the member and told them that changes of this sort needed to originate with MPB.  I sent them the Change Form Link.  I received it back and will send it to Sedera.  I will process addition of dependent.  No change in price since already a family membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-25 07:24:18', '2025-07-25 07:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168792006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121138002', 'Viva Chan', NULL, 'Member submitted new payment method.  I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-25 07:01:54', '2025-07-25 07:01:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168792001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Member called in right after billing for 8/25 Share Amount to let us know that payment would decline.  He then submitted new pmt info.  I just received notification of decline.  I will rerun with info that member submitted', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-25 06:51:49', '2025-07-25 06:51:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168715061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124672026', 'Jessica Bartmann', NULL, '7-24-25 I helped Jessica update her address bc C4 passed her over to me in case it changed the plan price and benefits. Nothing changed. I updated her address above.  She''s all set. Her income is about $72K-$74K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-24 17:23:55', '2025-07-24 17:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168715014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, '7-24-25 Gordon is 57 and wife 55. They are both self-employed. 2 kids are off on their own now, 2 is in college and the other is 11. The college and 11 yr old will be on the membership. Gordon has high blood pressure and now high cholesterol. I read the high blood pressure exemption from the current Sedera Select Guidelines and I let him know the cholesterol is no longer showing as an exemption. He takes meds for both of those ongoing. No tobacco for anyone and they do their annual wellness visits. I shared Premium HSA and the differences with what he had previously vs Premium HSA as well as the pre-x clause. He enrolled EF $1500/$895 and I waived $100 of the $125 since he''s been a member before. He might need proof of ins for his daughter for camp. MPB may be able to send him the digital copy before his start date. He''s all set and happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-24 14:53:56', '2025-07-24 14:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168715009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '7-24-25 From Andi, 

Hi Wendy, 
thanks so much for ending up paying for my mammogram. 
That''s amazing. 
Thanks so much,

--
Andi
Life is good!

Obviously, I''m not the one who paid but I''m happy our team helped her get it paid for successfully.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-24 14:44:14', '2025-07-24 14:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168722021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115515002', 'Osha Waters', NULL, '7/24/25


Osha called to inquire about special coverage options for college students under our plan. I explained that the coverage is the same for all members, regardless of student status. She mentioned that her children''s university requires them to have health insurance. I clarified that while we are not traditional health insurance, we can provide a **Letter of Participation**.

Osha asked if this letter would be sufficient proof for the university. I let her know that requirements vary by school, and advised her to contact the university directly to find out what documentation they require. I assured her that we are happy to provide any materials we can to support her needs and will do our best to accommodate her.
AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-24 14:29:25', '2025-07-24 14:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168749020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, '07/24/2025
