  ('zcrm_1579374000168715004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, '7-24-25 Angelika called and we discussed her address. She said it''s always been FL as her primary address. She never changed the address to her knowledge and definitely didn''t do so recently. She thought maybe it was because she had an appointment in NM. She submitted the Member Change Form to make sure everything shows her FL address. She''s happy to show her driver''s license and registration if need be. I informed Patti who has already sent a note to Sedera as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-24 13:22:21', '2025-07-24 13:22:21'),
