  ('zcrm_1579374000168702048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168271008', 'Ekue Deganus', NULL, 'Member enrolled in the $2500 IUA in error.  He then re-enrolled in the $1000 and then put a stop pmt on the $125 enrollment fee in the 2nd enrollment.  I will refund & cancel all monies from first enrollment then recharge Enrollment Fee & 1st months Share Amount on correct enrollment.
