  ('zcrm_1579374000168672013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, '7-23-25 Patti just forwarded this to me regarding her place of residence. It looks like she changed her address immediately following enrollment for Oct. 1st, 2024.  She should change it to FL if that''s still her primary residence.

From: noreply@salesforce.com <noreply@salesforce.com> on behalf of Sedera Member Services <memberservices@sedera.com>
Sent: Wednesday, July 23, 2025 10:52 AM
To: anhellmer@gmail.com <anhellmer@gmail.com>
Cc: pbaron mympb.com <pbaron@mympb.com>
Subject: Sedera Membership Cancellation
 
Hello Angelika, 

It was recently brought to our attention that your address was updated to the state of New Mexico.

Unfortunately, we have not been actively operating in the state of New Mexico since 2023.

After a lengthy and respectful discussion with their office of superintendent of insurance, we agreed to make the difficult decision to voluntarily comply with their request to cease operations. We chose to do so in order to preserve the opportunity to re-enter the state when the law is more conducive to innovative and fresh thinking. 

As such, we will have to cancel your Sedera membership effective July 31, 2025.

From the bottom of our hearts, thank you for being a member of our community. It has been an honor to serve you. If you have any questions or concerns that are not addressed here, please contact us by responding to this email or calling us at 855–973–3372 between 8 AM to 6 PM central time Monday through Friday.

Best Regards,
Ashley Z.

Sedera Member Services
855.973.3372
Available Monday - Friday
8am-6pm CST
Sedera.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-23 15:04:39', '2025-07-23 15:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168670084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144059002', 'Blaine Boren', NULL, 'Member called in from his bank not sure what we were charging him for.  I asked to speak to the member who told me that he was not getting any correspondence from us.  Member knew that address on account was ex spouses address.  I advised that I could send him the Change Form Link to update his address.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-23 14:27:51', '2025-07-23 14:27:51'),
