  ('zcrm_1579374000168467107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166459011', 'Cindy Lee', NULL, 'Cindy and husband called back wanting to know how to handle preventive care, mamm, labs, etc. What is and how to use HCBB, and we quickly touched base on Zion and large medical needs. Emailed ACA guidelines per member request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-21 08:57:19', '2025-07-21 08:57:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168467088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155394034', 'Chelsea Askew', NULL, '7/21/25: Chelsea called asking how to go about getting some imaging done. She can''t get into her pcp for a while and thinks this is not a good use of the ER or urgent care. She wants to get an image of brain bc she thinks she may have suffered a concussion a few months ago. I recommended using her telehealth service and helped her start process within HW. Also emailed her imaging quote form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-21 08:39:50', '2025-07-21 08:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168467083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153960002', 'Deziree Worster', NULL, '7/21/25: Deziree emailed in asking if Sarah Crane is in network and for a list of codes. The site did show her listed, provided screenshot as well as member ID and credentials. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-21 08:24:09', '2025-07-21 08:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168467064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, '7/21/25: Nancy called. She has quite a few bills and called before to get assistance with them. They include some diagnostic services, mamm, pap, office visit...She paid for office visit with HSA, and now unsure of how to get everything separated for sharing request and preventive. I advised her not to worry about splitting up the bill for sharing request, she can detail the services to Zion when uploading. As for preventive bills, I let her know that those would need to be billed to ARM from provider. She seemed very uncertain and wanted help so she is emailing what she has to concierge email - will take a look and get back to Nancy with clear instructions. 

