  ('zcrm_1579374000168356085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', NULL, '7-18-25 Brooke and Scott are enrolling in Premium Care. Brooke has a thyroid issue and medical massage for a neck/shoulder injury that is doing well now.  She disclosed those on the app. Scott takes buproprion for anxiety and chiro visits for back 1-3x per year. I explained the pre-x clause again to both of them and they understand it well. They both watched the video too but I explained the correct pre-x clause. They are super nice!  They know they can also receive $100 Referral Fee if they refer someone who joins. Scott is the primary. He could join Brooke''s possible ins with Primera for $700 or Cobra for $1200 with Primera. He was asking about backdating if something happens in July today onward.  Their ins ended 6-31-25. I also let them know with Premium Care they are protected for a new accident now but starting Aug. 1st onward. They are very happy. Brooke may remove herself once her new job pays for her benefits. Scott will likely remain indefinitely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-18 14:45:18', '2025-07-18 14:45:18'),
