  ('zcrm_1579374000168298135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '7-16-25 Gretchen enrolled in Care+ $550/$2500. She may choose to upgrade for 2026 or 2027 if her husband is ready to do a colonoscopy. Otherwise, they don''t use much of the wellness benefits. She will not be doing a mammogram any time soon. Son doesn''t do the wellness visits. She might only do a pap screening. She knows if they switch they need to do so for Jan. 1st effective date. She doesn''t believe they have any pre-x. All set for Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-17 09:40:13', '2025-07-17 09:40:13'),
