  ('zcrm_1579374000168270102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168270081', 'Fletcher Yaw', NULL, '7-16-25 Fletcher is separating from Valerie Yaw and needs his own membership now. He has a lapse in July. So, he can switch to Premium Care. He''s 52 and super healthy, never sick, never goes to the drs., no meds. He''s an athlete and skis, bikes, etc. He''s happy to hear about Premium Care at $299/$1000 or $1500/$267. He will review the overview and we will talk on Friday to enroll at 12:15.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 16:40:55', '2025-07-16 16:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168270076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, '7-16-25 Looking to understand the Needs process and possible pre-approval for their functional medicine dr. Looking to get pregnant and want to make sure everything is looking good for best success.  Their functional dr. is also an MD. They may run a bunch of labs. I told him to use the MPB Concierge Team for the best prices on labs. He will do so after submitting for pre-approval with Zion.  I also reiterated the Pre-x clause again in case that plays a part in what they are facing. He seems to think it''s not relevant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 16:27:54', '2025-07-22 10:02:35'),
