  ('zcrm_1579374000168270061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '7-16-25 I helped Patty fill out the health ins form to get approved by Pepperdyne. The questions were a little weird but I think we answered everything correctly. It asked about max benefit amount. I believe they mean what is the cap, so we put unlimited since no max cap. It didn''t sound like they were asking for Max Out of Pocket. We will see if this works. They don''t accept health sharing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 13:53:02', '2025-07-16 13:53:02'),
