  ('zcrm_1579374000168246151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131712017', 'Jeffrey Merrifield', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking why he was cancelled.  I explained that we had issues with the A123 account &amp; routing  number issues.  I explained that this was retried thru FTNI but the bank declined the pmt.  Member was unresponsive to voice mails &amp; em about this issue.  I reinstated for an 8/1/25 Start date and will retry billing with the information that he gave me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-16 12:43:24', '2025-07-16 12:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168270039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161676496', 'McKenzie Mann', NULL, '7-16-25 McKenzie called and I just called him back but his vm is full. So, I sent him a text instead. He has some questions about his membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 12:40:42', '2025-07-16 12:40:42'),
