  ('zcrm_1579374000168270034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '7-16-25 Julia called bc she learned that her reimbursement $ for HAB was going into their rental property account bc it''s tied to their email address. They must have their rental propery payments tied to Hint already since it''s recognizing their email address. She doesn''t want to change the email address used on the account. So, she will request HAB pays them via check moving forward. She wanted me to know in case I could do anything about it. But, HAB is tied into Hint and there''s nothing to be done on that front. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 12:23:41', '2025-07-16 12:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168270029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '7-16-25 Looks like she called Concierge per my recommendation to get help with bone density scan.  So, I didn''t call back since getting taken care of.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-16 12:13:21', '2025-07-16 12:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168247686', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '7/16/25: Emailed Jodi general prices for the prescription quote request she submitted. I didn''t clip the coupons because she doesn''t actually need to fill these till August - we were just seeing what kind of prices she was looking at for the future. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-16 11:51:34', '2025-07-16 11:51:34'),
