  ('zcrm_1579374000168202059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '7-15-25 Figge wants to understand his benefits again. He didn''t sign up for HAB by accident. He thought he did. He called them and they have no record of his enrollment nor do I. He takes responsibility for it. He wants wellness included and mental health, so he may upgrade to Premium HSA. Since the new virtual health will cover mental health and prescribers for his meds it will benefit him to upgrade now. CirrusMD will no longer prescribe his ADHD med bc they have false info on his record and are telling him he''s had too much already even though it''s not true. He says they did the math wrong. I sent him Premium Care Handbook for his current membership, Premium HSA Overview for possible new membership, info on MPB''s new virtual health app and the video for his accountant to understand the membership. Hopefully he''s all set and will decide before the 18th whether or not to upgrade.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-15 18:08:27', '2025-07-15 21:01:52'),
