  ('zcrm_1579374000168178755', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '7/15/25
Received an email from Jody to see if some expensive heart med would be covered for a pending sharing request responded via email AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 14:41:10', '2025-07-15 14:41:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178750', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', '7/15/25', 'I contacted ARM to confirm the correct diagnosis code for a preventative colonoscopy. I provided the code used by Dr. Benjamin Renelus, which was Z12.11. ARM confirmed that this is the appropriate code for a preventative colonoscopy and emphasized that coverage determination is based on the diagnosis being clearly coded as preventative.

Additionally, I asked ARM to verify whether anyone had contacted them previously to confirm eligibility and coverage. ARM stated that no such call had been made and that there was no record of any eligibility verification for this procedure.

I informed Sundata of this and advised him to reschedule the procedure to allow enough time to ensure all coverage and eligibility information is verified and accurate.

Later, Sundata relayed that Vicky at Wellstar Hospital (470-644-6660) told him during a separate call that she had contacted ARM and was informed that outpatient benefits would not be covered. To clarify this discrepancy, I contacted ARM again directly.

ARM confirmed that outpatient benefits are covered when the colonoscopy is a routine preventative procedure performed in an outpatient setting, but they emphasized the importance of being very specific when confirming this type of coverage.

Action Needed: If Vicky or anyone from the hospital calls back with additional questions or concerns, please arrange a four-way call including ARM, the hospital, the patient (if applicable), and our team. This will help ensure all parties are on the same page regarding coverage and coding.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 14:32:35', '2025-07-15 14:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168170013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', '07/15/2025', 'Wants to know about chiropractic care, just has Nerve pain, in general shoulder and traps are tight, feels like he pulled something on his lower back, lays down to go to bed and his lower back is throbbing.  Sent him the link to request an appointment from us, also explained to him that he needs a diagnosis and treatment plan prescribed by an MD for it to be shareable through zion after IUA. Let him know after he submits the form we''ll get back to him in a few days.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-07-15 14:27:07', '2025-07-15 14:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168176081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118133001', 'Stephen Hultquist', NULL, 'Left voicemail regarding price increase.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-07-15 14:25:17', '2025-07-15 14:25:17'),
