  ('zcrm_1579374000168170008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651027', 'Jenell Henson', '07/15/2025', 'She called in asking how to submit a member need (her husband has an ablation scheduled for september  - cashpay price is $79,000, discounted $19,000 for self pay) I informed her to call back into the concierge once her need is ready to submit and then we''ll transfer her over to zion so she can open her member portal and submit the bills. She also has several doctors visits for the same incident to submit, to add up to the IUA.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-07-15 14:07:08', '2025-07-15 14:07:08'),
