  ('zcrm_1579374000168174111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-15 12:31:36', '2025-07-15 12:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178735', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, '7/15/25

SUN called this morning upset that his colonoscopy would not be covered. I informed him that the procedure would be covered as long as it is coded as preventative. I informed him i had spoke to the provider  relayed this information to them as well.

The member stated that ARM told him it would not be covered because it is considered surgical. I explained that the procedure is only considered surgical if polyps are found and removed, which would then make it diagnostic*rather than preventative.

I provided a brief explanation of the difference between a **diagnostic** and a **preventative** colonoscopy for his understanding. The member shared the codes provided by the doctor, and after a quick search, we determined that the codes were clearly diagnostic. I advised him to speak with his provider and request that the claim be coded as **preventative**, if that accurately reflects the purpose of the visit.

AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 12:21:49', '2025-07-15 12:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178730', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, '7/15/25: Sundiata called - he''s very frustrated. Said he''s been going back and forth with MPB, ARM, Hospital and Provider''s office about a colonoscopy he has scheduled for tomorrow. The issue is that ARM said they will not pay with it being coded as is, hospital will not change code - only drs office can do that. 

Called Dr. Morisett''s office who said they referred him to the gastroenterologist below for a preventive screening colonoscopy. Confirmed with Sundiata that is correct. Sundiata said he never actually saw Dr. Renelus but that is the gastro performing the procedure. 

Need to call gastro - 943-202-7120 - Dr. Benjamin Renelus, and see if they can change the order to preventive. Also promised Sundiata a call back today so he knows whether or not he needs to proceed with procedure tomorrow. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 12:08:41', '2025-07-15 12:08:41'),
