  ('zcrm_1579374000168178600', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '7/15/25: Patty called back bc she still can''t access Cirrus and needs to make a telehealth appt for son Rowan. I advised her to use health wallet - she was able to get in and start process while we were on the phone. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 11:25:42', '2025-07-15 11:25:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178571', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156314002', 'Dan Bolkema', NULL, '7/15/25: Tanya called. She spoke to telehealth dr who advised her to see an urgent care or ER. She wanted to make sure she approached the situation correctly. We discussed how to present as self pay and that there are no network restrictions. Will check in a couple weeks to make sure she knows how to start sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 11:08:45', '2025-07-15 11:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168202051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168202017', 'Sean Coyne', NULL, '7-15-25 Janet, Sean''s mom, set up first and ongoing payments with Cigna but will call them in 7-10 biz days to make sure it''s all set. She will also upload the proof of end of benefits due to aging up to 26 and no longer dependent. I showed her GoodRX to get his meds at $2-$20 instead of $35 generic co-pay! He need alprazalam, sertraline, buproprion and omaprazole. She chose the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 at $341.66 for Aug. 1st. She will choose a dental discount plan option later when she knows what dentist she wants. She has the 1Dental link to decide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-15 10:57:57', '2025-07-15 10:58:09'),
