  ('zcrm_1579374000168178556', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, '7/15/25: Julie emailed in asking for us to educate her on how they are able to contribute to their HSA account bc someone told her healthshare plans cannot. I explained how the MEC qualifies them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 10:39:47', '2025-07-15 10:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178551', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144777002', 'Thomas Newton', NULL, '7/15/25: Started doing some research for Kristi''s colo appt scheduling request. PHCS only lists 1 option in her area and it''s not a current listing. I sent Lori an email asking what her options are and if ARM would pay for the closest place - St. Mary''s Hospital which according to HCBB, is priced at $2800. 
Called Kristi to give her an update on what I''ve learned so far. She said she''s also be willing to drive to Athens or Augusta, GA. Will wait and see what Lori says before exploring facilities in those towns. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 10:35:35', '2025-07-15 11:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000168178546', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149295021', 'Lara Radojcic Llosa', NULL, '7/15/25
Lara and her husband have called numbers times today to ask her plan works she presented back pain and went to the ER and she needs surgery. I explained to them she has to meet her IUA, and for diagnostic concerns like this to present as cash pay and to not present the ARM card. I explained the process of how process working and what to do in different scenarios. They seem more receptive of this information but they still have their doubts Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 10:35:16', '2025-07-15 10:35:16'),
