  ('zcrm_1579374000168202001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168201002', 'Emily Armstrong', NULL, '7-15-25 Emily is enrolling in Secure HSA and will fund the HSA. She''s choosing $1000/$780 for Aug. 1st since she sees the higher IUA''s don''t really make sense financially. She also wants the dental discount plan and it includes vision which they only use a little. So, no need to pay for a separate vision plan. She''s due in 10 days but will not go past her due date of the 27th.  She will get induced if it goes past her due state. She''s super uncomfortable now. Emily joined the Preferred Plan with both networks since they don''t have a dentist yet. She chose it for the whole family at $29.95 and starts right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-15 09:25:47', '2025-07-15 09:44:11'),
