  ('zcrm_1579374000168178101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144777002', 'Thomas Newton', NULL, '7/15/25: Kristi called with questions about plan. Said she''s still having issues getting a colo scheduled - said she''d fill out appt sched request today. Asked about presenting for mamm appt - present card. Asked about prev labs her dr ordered through quest - have quest bill ARM directly (she may get a balance bill if any are diagnostic). How long does it take Zion to process sharing request? Her husband JUST submitted one for ER visit -kidney stone -- I said to give it about 2-4 weeks to process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-15 08:28:06', '2025-07-15 08:28:06'),
