  ('zcrm_1579374000168125043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', NULL, '7-14-25 Brooke 49 and husband 49 called me right back and I explained Premium Care. They live in Juneau AK and were referred by Rachel Namordi. I spoke with  Brooke today and she will have her husband join us on Friday when we meet again. Husband turns 50 in Oct. so I explained Premium Care. They already did their colonoscopies not too long ago and don''t need another one for 5-10 more years. She does her mammo every few years and is fine paying for pap screening on own. This way they won''t have any network limitations where they live. She worked for the Juneau School District and can get Cobra for $2200 for the two of them! She''s looking for other jobs that may cover her in the future. But, her husband is self-employed. We might want to have him be the primary. Brooke has hyperthyroidism and it might get changed to hypothyroidism. She takes levothyroxine and pays a $10 co-pay right now. She''s working with a nutritionist and takes supplements to better improve her thyroid condition. He husband is healthy. One of them is getting medically prescribed massages for some lower back pain. I explained the pre-x clause and she understands it. I also let her know the video is old and pre-x clause is different from what is explained there. No tobacco and no other meds. She''s interested in Premium Care $1000/$603, $125/$25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-14 16:19:08', '2025-07-14 16:19:08'),
