  ('zcrm_1579374000168079016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149295021', 'Lara Radojcic Llosa', NULL, '7/14/25
Lara called regarding two medical bills she paid out-of-pocket:

OBGYN yearly appointment, Mammogram, followed by an ultrasound and MRI
I informed Lara that only the OBGYN visit and mammogram are considered preventive care and therefore eligible for reimbursement. The ultrasound and MRI are considered diagnostic and not eligible under preventive care guidelines.
