  ('zcrm_1579374000167964044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '7/10/25
David called because he was under the impression he would received a new MEC card do to his plan recently changing, I explained to him that he no longer has a mec and that he only has the health share. David is having a surgery and wanted us to provide him with an rx card, i also explained he would not receive one and that we can assitst him with an rx quote. He was unhappy with my response and said that this was an inconvenient  process and he did not have time to fill out that form each time he needed an rx AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 13:35:43', '2025-07-10 13:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167964025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '7/10/25
Kimberly called to see if boulder community hospital has submitted her bill for her mammogram, I confirmed that they have not AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 13:31:56', '2025-07-10 13:31:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167964006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553052', 'Jesus Estrella', NULL, '7/10/25
Jesus needed assistance with logging in into his member portal. He was unable to log in and wanted to use telehealth services. I advised him to use health wallet instead to which he explained he was unable to register his wife. I informed him that his wife was not on his plan there for she could not use it. He insisted she was and that he had been using his arm card at provider visits and even dentist appointment and that they all have been covered. He even stated the dentist called for legibly and we said the wife was included. I explained that no claims where submitted for his wife and that we do not include dental in our plan to please reach out to his employer to rectify any confusion on his membership with us AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 13:21:39', '2025-07-10 13:21:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167986007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '07.10.25:  Was informed Jocelyn''s membership would be cancelled as of 6/30/25 due to nonpayment (cc declined). Texted Jocelyn to see if she wanted to be reinstated or not. Jocelyn responded her membership should have been reinstated last week and to check with Patti.  She said her husband died in February and it''s been very difficult for her since then. I messaged Patti to confirm Jocelyn''s reinstatement. Patti said she was able to reinstate Jocelyn''s membership for 7/1/25 and was given another method of payment (cc). Jocelyn was enrolled in SECURE HSA (45800) as of 1/1/25 @ $336/mo and, as of 7/1/25, is now paying $346.08/mo. due to cc.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-07-10 13:00:29', '2025-07-11 10:50:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167961093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156744021', 'Tyler Metzler', NULL, 'Received Cancellation from employer for this member eff 8/1/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-10 12:46:05', '2025-07-10 12:46:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167961086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, 'This member was transferred to me by the Concierge.  He had alot of concerns around the fact that he no longer had the Co-Pay membership and wanted to know how to use his membership for those services that used to be handled by the MEC.  He has some preventative stuff coming up for his children and he has a surgery as well that he has opened a need for w/Sedera.  He told me he was told that he now had the HDHP MEC by someone else.  I told him that that was not the case.  I told him he could add the MEC to his membership since he was a business owner.  I went over the differences in the 2 MEC''s.  I sent him the Change Form Link and gave him pricing as he wanted that to be added.  He is aware that that will be effective 8/1/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-10 12:30:07', '2025-07-10 12:30:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167988001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159997002', 'Kira Lewis', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4311 Question : Is o ring or IUD covered under my insurance?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2025-07-10 12:09:22', '2025-07-10 12:09:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167965540', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '7/10/25: Jodi called with a few more questions about Daniel''s issue and trying to understand how the IUA worked. We discussed issue specific, telehealth and accessing cirrus md, smaller appointments that accumulate, how prescription discounts worked (emailed rx quote form) and that the meds prescribed during hospital visit are part of need. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 11:35:32', '2025-07-10 11:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167961081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982018', 'Christina O''Connor', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-10 11:21:20', '2025-07-10 11:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167961073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167983001', 'Eric Person', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-10 11:18:10', '2025-07-10 11:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167961065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982002', 'Kathleen Meckel', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-07-10 11:14:04', '2025-07-10 11:14:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167965535', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120539002', 'Michael Morby', NULL, '7/10/25: Kari called with questions about IUA and how to navigate the plan. We discussed that the IUA is issue specific and the 6 month deadline. Advised her to simply collect itemized statements for her bills and if she expects the issue to go over IUA or she''s coming close to 6 month deadline, then begin submitting. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 11:06:57', '2025-07-10 11:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167962120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166746002', 'Alexandru Parasca', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 11:04:24', '2025-07-10 11:04:24'),
