  ('zcrm_1579374000167965516', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166682002', 'Cathy Cole', NULL, '7/10/25: Cathy called, she can''t register for MPB app - said it''s just opens a blank page when she attempts to register. I''ve also had another person today say the same is happening when attempting a provider search through app. Letting IT know about issue and will get back to (promised a call) Cathy when I learn more. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-10 10:33:28', '2025-07-10 10:33:28'),
