  ('zcrm_1579374000167915101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086032', 'Fadi Malouf', NULL, '7/9/25: Fadi called - he was the victim of an accident and hit by a car. He said Zion is denying his bills. I let him know that unfortunately, he''s not an active member with MPB and cancelled his policy in 2022. He asked if he re-enrolled would there be any way we can help him. I let him know that technically, if he re-enrolled, then the membership would start beginning of next month, but we would do everything we can to figure out the situation and go to bat for him in our capacity. I advised he go ahead and file an appeal with Zion and I would speak to my peers about what we could do from our end if he re-enrolled. Let him know I''d call back no later than tomorrow. 

Called Fadi back, but his VM said it''s not best to leave a vm. Sending him an email with what I was able to learn from Julia/Patti - it would be best he wait out Zion''s processing since according to their guidelines, they will only share into automobile accidents after the at fault person''s insurance has been exhausted and cancelling and re-enrolling may complicate the situation. If after they''ve gone through the right steps, he still gets a hard denial, he can reach back out - we could check and see if he qualifies for any hospital debt relief options.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-09 08:22:12', '2025-07-09 11:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167914114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167583028', 'Benjamin Wilkey', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of August 1, 2025. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-09 08:04:12', '2025-07-09 08:04:12'),
