  ('zcrm_1579374000167915006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126354002', 'Paulette Schaap', NULL, '7/9/5: Paulette emailed in a link to bill that was sent to Planstin. I advised her that IF this is a prev bill(I can''t view from what she provided), have provider resubmit to ARM. 
