  ('zcrm_1579374000167761104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', '7/7/25', 'Lisa regarding a pending \$5,000 bill from her daughter’s ER visit, which has now been sent to collections. She stated she is receiving daily calls about it. I asked if she had paid the remaining \$343.58 to meet her IUA, and she confirmed that she had.

Lisa requested that we contact the hospital on her behalf to explain the situation. I informed her that at this time, I was unsure of the status of her sharing request and could not speak to the hospital on Zion’s behalf.

To help clarify the issue, I initiated a three-way call with Zion. During the call, it appeared that the hospital had sent a HIPAA release form to Zion, but Zion claimed they did not receive it. There also seem to be pre-existing condition concerns noted in the sharing request.

We were unable to reach the processor assigned to the case. The Zion representative said they would have the processor follow up with Lisa directly.

AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-07 14:25:38', '2025-07-07 14:25:38'),
