  ('zcrm_1579374000167704021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '7/3/25
Paul called regarding an issue with payment for a  colonoscopy consultation that took place today for both himself and his wife. He explained that they were required to pay out of pocket for the consultations and were also asked to make a deposit for a pathology bill. The clinic had them listed as cash-pay patients.

I informed Paul that when the appointments were originally scheduled, I made sure the clinic had their ARM card on file and instructed them to bill ARM directly.

Paul stated that when they arrived at the clinic, the staff took them to the back and informed them that the ARM card does not cover the consultation or colonoscopy.

To clarify the situation, I contacted ARM and confirmed that no eligibility verification had been done by the clinic. I attempted to reach the clinic multiple times to understand where the disconnect occurred, but they have  not responded to my calls. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-03 13:39:33', '2025-07-03 13:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167704016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129992001', 'Michael Rogers', NULL, '7/3/25
Micheal called because he has a manufacture coupon for a x and need the prescription portion of his card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-03 13:32:11', '2025-07-03 13:32:11');
