  ('zcrm_1579374000167587013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168256006', 'Nytashia Allbritton', NULL, '7-1-25 Nytashia is 33 and her partner is 36 or 37. They''ve lived together for about 6 or 8 years, I forget. He''s a finish carpenter. She will be operating her own health coaching business. She''s getting out of fed government job and has ins. benefits through July 31st. She has ulcerative proctitis since she was 26. She take a med which is generic and is about $45 for 30 which will last her about a year. It''s called mesalamine. She takes one as suppository and another even less often. She understands the pre-x clause. She doesn''t do wellness but is more interested in Secure HSA and may fund the HSA as well. Likes $1000/$336 and possibly add her guy $1000/$578.  She doesn''t smoke or use tobacco. They lives in Boise Idaho and she was referred by Mary Sundblom.  We will revisit mid July.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-07-01 23:11:22', '2025-07-01 23:11:22'),
