  ('zcrm_1579374000167536096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156171033', 'Brecken Bunnell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-01 08:47:37', '2025-07-01 08:47:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167541446', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142011002', 'Jonathan Chan', NULL, '7/1/25: Jenny is STILL emailing about a labcorp bill. I called ARM to check on this. It appears to be the same bill she''s been talking about all along. It was diagnostic, $1700ish and from back in November. ARM adjusted the bill and now there is a balance bill of $464.17 which was sent to member along with an EOB.
Emailed Jenny the following: AM

Hi Jenny,
I reached out to Altrisk on your behalf, and they confirmed their clearing house received the bill — Invoice #4805416. They shared that since not all of the codes were classified as preventive, there is a remaining balance and an Explanation of Benefits (EOB) was also sent out for your records.
Just a quick note for the future: MPB Concierge do not process preventive claims and have limited access to them, but we’re always here to help guide you in using your benefits effectively. For any detailed questions regarding this bill, please contact Altrisk directly at 800-392-1770.
Best,
Angee', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-07-01 08:18:12', '2025-07-01 08:18:12'),
