  ('zcrm_1579374000167541001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118172010', 'David Slabaugh', NULL, '7/1/25: Called to FU with Emily regarding the hospital bill reimbursement. I see they cancelled but wanted to make sure all that got squared away. LVM. 
