  ('zcrm_1579374000167499696', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '6/30/25: Art called wondering if the shingles is covered. I explained that it isn''t. He was interested in the cost of a plan to add preventive to his benefits. I let him know the cost and suggested he speak to Wendy if he''s interested in switching up his benefits. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-30 17:44:39', '2025-06-30 17:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167499663', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '6/30/25: Jennifer called. She had a visit with gyno and ultrasound that ended up with biopsy. The bills are about to exceed her IUA and wondering how this works. I let her know how to submit, and pay up to IUA etc. Setting reminder to check on everything in a couple weeks to make sure she''s good with the process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-30 16:32:48', '2025-06-30 16:32:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167499658', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131969002', 'Simone Noble', NULL, '6/30/25: Simone called. She is wanting to have A LOT of labs done through her naturopath and wondering the best cost option. She says they are all preventive but her dr does not bill insurance. She''s already plugged them into Jason Health but wondering if there are any other avenues she could try. I advised her to submit a quote request and let us do a bit of research. 
My plan is to see if there are any reimbursement rates through ARM for labs she includes and to try other sites for comparison. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-30 16:13:40', '2025-06-30 16:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167499633', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda called about the email she got about Colton being removed at age 26 but he''s only 25. Checked DOB and it is 2000. She also said her daughter Megan has an upcoming need. She had a foot injury and will need physical therapy. I let her know the Sedera limits for PT and how that would work. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-30 15:52:51', '2025-06-30 16:03:24'),
