  ('zcrm_1579374000167506063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '6-30-25 I showed Sara how I couldn''t see her plan on the Review Plans page. It shows now current enrollment. I just pushed through her enrollment again with her SEP of leaving Regis and losing ins. today. We can see her new enrollment on the Review Plans page by clicking on Future Plans and it shows the new plan starting tomorrow. I also showed her how to upload her Cobra letter for her SEP to be proactive. She will do that once she finds her letter. She chose Kaise KP CO Option Gold $1698.37 with $1077.95 APTC. She already confirmed payment with Kaiser. She should be all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-30 15:16:46', '2025-06-30 15:16:46'),
