  ('zcrm_1579374000167506019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167659006', 'Richard Armitage', NULL, '6-30-25 Richard selected me as his broker and we got his account up to date with $80K income for right now with Janette''s income at $60K + commission of about $20K. He will get unemployment but believes that will take about 5 weeks or so. Then they want to switch to MCS for Aug. 1st anyhow. He''ll choose his plan today by 5:00 or 6:00 pm for July 1st start with C4. I need to let him know how to upload his Cobra letter to C4. We are talking on Wed. and he will watch the video with his wife Janette. He may also choose the cheapest plan since they are healthy and only need it for one month until MCS. They are healthy, no tobacco, no issues.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-30 12:59:41', '2025-06-30 12:59:41'),
