  ('zcrm_1579374000167499535', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839147', 'Ashleigh Bechtel', NULL, '6/30/2025: Ashleigh called - she''s getting a breast MRI done soon and wants to know if she needs approval. I said no approval, but I can check prices and give a quick quote over the phone. According to HCBB and Radiology Assist, the best price is around $450 and goes up to a fair price being $900. I recommended she call the facility she was referred to and if it''s way over $500, then call me back and I can give her ordering instructions for how to get it at a lower price. 

