  ('zcrm_1579374000167499003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128357001', 'Samuel Johnson', NULL, '6/30/25: Karen emailed a bunch of bills to us for labs, well woman visit and a children''s well visit. It looks like the well-woman visit was the only one sent to ARM. I advised her to reach out to the provider and have them send the claim directly to ARM. 
