  ('zcrm_1579374000167439016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167659006', 'Richard Armitage', NULL, '6-27-25 Richard wil lbe 58 in July and wife is 60. He was just let go from his W2/contract job that was supposed to turn into full time W2. His ins will end June 30th and he hasn''t received his Cobra letter yet but will inquire. He will be looking for a job ASAP. His wife is 1099 and earns about $5K per month. So, we''ll base it off her income for now. He has a C4 account and I asked him to make sure it''s working before out meeting. He found me via Jim and Karen Faydenko. He lives in CO. Needs ins to start July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-27 17:09:27', '2025-06-30 12:02:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167439006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168201002', 'Emily Armstrong', NULL, '6-27-25 Emily is 31, husband Ryan will be 38 in Aug. and 26 month (Asher) I think. She came via Suzy Martinek. Emily has known Suzy since Emily was in about 5th grade and Suzy is like a 2nd mom to her. Emily is currently FT and getting benefits through her employer. But, she''s planning to leave soon and do contract work. She has an EIN she can use for enrollment. He husband has been getting ins through his work but he just got a new job with no benefits now. They have a 2nd baby on the way and she''s due on July 27th. She wants an Aug. 1st start date, if all goes well with the birth. If not, she can stay with her current insurance until she''s ready to switch or cancel current plan. Other than the baby nobody has pre-x other than Emily taking Lexipro 5 mg. No tobacco and no other meds. She prefers the lowest IUA and likes flexibility in drs. She also like more natural solutions to include acupuncture, chiro, naturopaths, etc. They will do wellness visits and will fund the HSA. Network is good in Boulder County and likely for Westminster area as well. She also likes the mental health benefits. I told her about the new unlimited virtual mental health and Life Care for 12 visits in the private network. I also let her know these 12 visits with Life Care might disappear in the next 6 months or so. I quoted them Secure HSA $1000/$780 and $125/$25 for Aug. 1st start. We have another meeting July 15th or so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-27 16:13:54', '2025-06-27 16:13:54'),
