  ('zcrm_1579374000167326001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118212001', 'Rustin Glass', NULL, '6/26/25
Member called expressing frustration with the preventative care side of the plan.** He explained that when he attends appointments for preventative services, most providers are skeptical about his insurance card (ARM) and often refuse to bill us.

I clarified that it is private insurance, and acknowledged that it can sometimes cause confusion. I informed him that all the necessary billing information is located on the back of the card, including the name, PO Box, and instructions to either submit the claim or call us directly to verify eligibility.

The member also complained about the inaccuracy of the MultiPlan website. I let him know that we are happy to assist him in locating in-network providers directly if needed.

AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-26 08:42:00', '2025-06-26 08:42:00'),
