  ('zcrm_1579374000167261122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '6-25-25 Left vm for Roseann to update her billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-25 11:53:42', '2025-06-25 11:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167261117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, '6-25-25 Steve''s wife discovered her ob/gyn accepts the PHCS network. So, she''s all set on that front. He needs to get some form from the state to cancel his current ins until he turns 65 in a few years. Then he can return and get some coverage again. He''s up to speed on that front. Not my realm of expertise. His adult kids are getting themselves sorted out. We have our final appt on July 15th for enrollment into Premium HSA ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-25 11:49:37', '2025-06-25 11:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167255081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167214002', 'Kendra Simonson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-25 11:48:28', '2025-06-25 11:48:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167255073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167292012', 'Madison Dayhoff', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-25 11:45:51', '2025-06-25 11:45:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167261112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '6-25-25 Gretchen is interested in Secure HSA for the HSA to get the tax benefits or CARE+ since they never use the wellness screenings. She will see if it makes sense to pay more money to then get the tax savings or just choose Care+. They are all healthy, no pre-x, no meds and Steve quit smoking about a year ago.  Gretchen is 43, Steve 45 and son is turning 10 in a few weeks. She''s leaning toward the $2500 IUA since they never need anything. She will watch the video to get an even more solid understanding. I explained it but it was disjointed since we had talk back in Feb. also. She needs even more of a refresher. with the video. We have an appt set up for July 17th to revisit after her trip and mine. They live in OH.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-25 11:12:27', '2025-06-25 11:12:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167290077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164436001', 'Shelby Carter', NULL, '6/25/25: Hank emailed in asking how to update portal pw. Provided instructions. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-25 11:11:22', '2025-06-25 11:11:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167290055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', NULL, '6/25/25: Angela called with a LOT of questions about using her preventive benefits, in-network drs, what''s covered, labs, dermatology, HW app. Will check in with her in a couple weeks to make sure she''s good. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-25 11:05:35', '2025-06-25 11:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167261099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164112010', 'Megan Berry', NULL, '6-25-25 Per Patti, if Meg and Chris join Premium Care at $1000 IUA for maternity the MCS portion of membership is $500.22 and $2500 IUA is $398. It makes more sense to choose the lower IUA. This will save them $2000-$2500 depending on when she''s due. 

"Homebirths and Midwives are considered shareable expenses. However, please note that the use of doula services are considered unshareable.

For pregnancies that have an expected delivery date within the first nine (9) months of membership, the amount eligible for sharing for their maternity Needs Case from the pregnancy will be equal to the total Monthly Shares the Member has contributed from the beginning of their membership through the month of delivery. "

Meg is told by Ziot sharing the cost of midwives are nearly impossible. This is nuts! So, Sedera should be better on this front and actually help with some of the cost of the maternity as outlined above. It will make sense for them to switch to Premium Care.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-25 11:02:49', '2025-06-25 11:02:49'),
