  ('zcrm_1579374000167261079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781197', 'Daniel Siegrist', NULL, '6-25-25 Madison finally called me back and I walked her through the removal process and re-enrollment since she''s turning 26 in July. This will take effect Aug. 1st. She chose Premium Care and $1500 IUA / $223. I had her save he Quick Ref Guide and showed her how to sign up for the Welcome Call to make sure she re-registers for virtual health. She joined under JoinMPB.com/OurAbacus as List Bill bc she''s an employee of Daniel Siegrist as well as his daughter. She''s all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-25 10:49:20', '2025-06-25 10:49:20'),
