  ('zcrm_1579374000167103357', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061180', 'William Reyes', NULL, '6/23/25
Confirmed shingles vaccine is covered under the preventive portion of the plan per ACA guidelines. Informed member they can receive it at a local chain pharmacy by presenting their updated MEC card (must show "RX Valet" on the back). Advised that the pharmacy can contact the help desk if there are any issues. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-23 17:25:52', '2025-06-23 17:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167103309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '6/23/25
Donald called to confirm which of his insurance cards is the most up to date. I explained that the ARM card is his current and active insurance card, and that Planstin is no longer in use.

I also clarified the appropriate situations in which to use the ARM card, and when it would not apply. Additionally, I explained the role of Zion HealthShare, how it works, and when he would need to use it—specifically for large, unexpected medical expenses that meet his Initial Unshareable Amount (IUA).

We also reviewed lab coverage, and I explained that labs are only covered when associated with a preventive wellness check under his current plan. Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-23 17:13:00', '2025-06-23 17:13:00'),
