Please know that we’re here to help—if there’s anything I can assist you with directly, I’d be happy to do so. I understand that our program functions differently from traditional health insurance, which can sometimes cause confusion.

If you have any questions or need further clarification, please don’t hesitate to reach out.

Best regards,
