  ('zcrm_1579374000167082140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142011002', 'Jonathan Chan', NULL, '6/23/25: Jenny emailed in asking how to submit her child''s wellness bill. I replied:
Hi Jenny. For preventive visits, you can simply show your benefit card at the appointment. Your provider will handle billing directly with Altrisk.
 If you haven’t paid for the visit yet, then just give the provider’s office a quick call and ask them to submit the claim to the address listed on the back of your card.
 And of course, if you need any help along the way, don’t hesitate to reach out to us at 800-519-2969.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-23 07:35:48', '2025-06-23 07:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167082107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '6/23/25: Tal emailed in asking if there is an access code to use HCBB - I replied with code and gave him additional login info, plus offered to do a custom search for him. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-23 07:26:45', '2025-06-23 07:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000167082052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120892002', 'Carly Swift', NULL, '6/23/25: Carly emailed in asking how to get her therapist to join network. I advised her to reach out to MSEAP and provide them with her therapist''s info - they will then send over the required paperwork. Then she asked why sleep apnea is not shareable. Let her know that it is listed as not shareable under Zion''s guidelines, but as for why - she is welcome to reach out and ask and provided contact info. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-23 07:19:52', '2025-06-23 08:29:45'),
