  ('zcrm_1579374000166915713', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '6-19-25 Jill called HAB and expected them to help her with her Premium Care membership, no longer understanding they are separate memberships. HAB called me bc they were concerned that she enrolled in only Preventive and not the Co-Op. I let HAB know that I''d call Jill. Jill was very concerned bc she thought she lost her benefits for accident, injuries and illnesses. I explained everything to her and Eric again. She has the HAB brochure and knows the payments are separate and on the 20th and 1st. I''ll send them the Premium Care Handbook now. Eric found his Welcome email from Health Access and will forward to Jill. Jill wants all companies to send emails to both of them. I let her know most companies only send the emails to the primary member. Eric''s willing to change to email to hers but she doesn''t seem interested in doing that. Either way, I believe she understands it for now. I also let her know she can use Redirect for one finally month, if she needs.  She wasn''t even all that enthused about that in spite of losing Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-19 14:04:02', '2025-06-19 14:04:02'),
