  ('zcrm_1579374000166915526', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '6/19/25
Charlen called from the hospital with a patient advocate confused on what the health share will cover. I explained the the guidelines do say the outpatient therapy is eligible for a sharing request. The patient advocate was under the impression that nothing is covered because they spoke to a rep her with us and we said nothing is covered. I informed them that they might have called the wrong department and guided the to review Zions guidelines and educate them on how this plan works AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-19 12:19:24', '2025-06-19 14:22:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166915521', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097899002', 'Amy Jones', NULL, '6-19-25 Jane asked me to take over Amy''s account. Jane connected us yesterday and I responded via email. I also just left Amy a vm just now. She needs to complete the Change Advisor form and she needs to update her name. Looks like we will want to review the membership to see if any changes make sense.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-19 12:17:35', '2025-06-19 12:17:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166906137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115913001', 'Brian Abernethy', 'New membership eff 7/25', 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-19 12:16:27', '2025-06-19 12:16:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166906132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115913001', 'Brian Abernethy', NULL, 'We received authorization from employer to process request to add dependents to this membership eff 7/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-19 12:14:13', '2025-06-19 12:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166915516', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168462023', 'David Tracht', NULL, '6-19-25 David and Ann haven''t been able to talk with Diane yet re ACA. They determined Piedmont accepts the PHCS network and their PCP accepts it. Ann will double check with her gyno. His work situation is still a bit uncertain as to when and how he will leave. So, they are now focused on Aug. 1st start date. I let them know about how Cobra works purely from what clients tell me and how Premium HSA will not consider a new incident as pre-x once someone has enrolled to when the start date begins. So, they will be best served to enroll as soon as they make a decision. They understand.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-19 12:12:37', '2025-06-19 12:12:37'),
