  ('zcrm_1579374000166697476', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127834010', 'Desmond Agostini', NULL, '6/16/25: Desmond called wanting to inquire about some office visits he''s going to for high blood pressure. And if those visits can count towards his IUA. I explained that in order to be shared, they need to be issue specific. Looked at Zion guidelines, and only saw one thing about high blood pressure- that''s it''s not considered a pre-membership condition. Let Desmond know he''d be cash pay -and urged him to go ahead and submit sharing request to get a determination from Zion on his specific need. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 11:53:40', '2025-06-16 11:53:40');
