  ('zcrm_1579374000166697121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141579020', 'Jonathan Smith', NULL, '6/16/25: Mary called. She received a bill from her her child''s preventive visit. Suggested she speak to ARM to make sure it was submitted correctly. Connected to them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 08:53:18', '2025-06-16 08:53:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166697086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '6/16/25: Returned Lynn''s call about opening a need. She''s opened a need in the past so she shouldn''t need to speak to zion directly.  She isn''t able to write down info at the moment and requested I send her written instructions. We also discussed guidelines around physical therapy. Sending link to Zion portal and how to navigate need. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 08:22:53', '2025-06-16 08:32:00'),
