  ('zcrm_1579374000166697054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '6/16/25: Called Mary Ann to FU - See if she was able to schedule a colo appt ok. She''s already gone for the consultation which was $250, and scheduled the colo for July 2nd and it''s around $2000. She requested I send her this contact info via email. Sending over link to portal as well as concierge number. Setting task for July. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 08:07:03', '2025-06-16 08:07:03'),
