  ('zcrm_1579374000166695032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088241002', 'Matthew Osborn', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she received communication from Zion stating that her sharing request had been denied and that her membership had been withdrawn.  I told her that I didn''t have access to that information and that she needed to contact Zion and ask for a reason since we are showing her as active.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-16 07:50:20', '2025-06-16 07:50:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166697033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149294001', 'Marshall Adams', NULL, '6/16/25: Called to schedule appt for Marshall at Low Country Rheumatology. LVM. Was finally able to reach them however they require a referral and patient documents sent over. Sent Marshall an email to have him send that over and he said the provider will be doing it Tuesday (6/17/25) Set a note to call back and schedule appt on 6/18. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 07:46:51', '2025-06-17 07:12:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166695024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, 'I received Cancellation Request eff 7/25 citing lack of funds.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-16 07:42:21', '2025-06-16 07:42:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166697025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, '6/16/25: Reached out to Lauren with what Cirrus said: Cirrus got back to me stating that they sent a new registration email to you and added both dependents to your account. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 07:40:04', '2025-06-16 07:40:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166697020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '6/16/25: Anzhelika responded still wanting the bills covered. I think she is misunderstanding how the health share works. Sent a simple explanation email on how to open a need and submit the bills if they are related to a large need that exceeds their IUA and urged her to call me so I can explain further. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-16 07:34:37', '2025-06-16 07:34:37'),
