  ('zcrm_1579374000166697001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '6/16/25: Charlene called. She''s in the ER and is having surgery today, and calling to understand next steps. I let her walked her through what she needs to collect, how the need would work and explained her IUA amount and what can be included in sharing request. She''s going to reach back out when she gets out of hospital to start need. AM
