  ('zcrm_1579374000166663032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133359001', 'Jianny Adamo', NULL, '6/13/25: Emailed Jianny an updated imaging quote. See below. AM

I personally called a handful of providers to ensure they offer both screening mammograms and ultrasounds and checked pricing. A screening mammogram is $0 as long as you stay within the PHCS network. 
