  ('zcrm_1579374000166663025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156134012', 'Sheryl Hunter', NULL, '6/13/25: Sheryl sent in her surgery estimate to me...but it stated it didn''t include anesthesia. Replied with the following:

While I don’t handle the estimate reviews directly (that all goes through Zion) in my opinion, this estimate is not complete, since the provider noted that anesthesia is not included.
My advice would be to go ahead and submit this to Zion now and call your processor today to see if it’s enough to receive initial funds. Then follow up with the remaining items once they’re available. 
If you’d like me to join you on a three-way call with Zion to help clarify things or move the process forward, I’m more than happy to do that - just let me know what works best for you.

