  ('zcrm_1579374000166637024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166640002', 'Gina Hale', NULL, '6-12-25 Gina is 60 and husband is 62 turning 63 in July. Her income is increasing which is making her ACA ins go from $300 to $1500. She may retire in 2026. She and her husband are healthy with a few basic meds. Gina take NP Thyroid 60 mg or levothyroxine. Husband takes amlodipine / olsmestran for blood pressure and famotidine 40 mg generic for Pepcid for indigestion. They want wellness visits, so Premium HSA is best for age and wellness. She takes some supplements too. She''s choosing $1500/$655, $125/$25.  The site is missing the $100 referral. She was referred by Sara Bollman! They all lives in St. Louis, MO. Gina is enrolling on I-Pad and running into troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-12 16:42:11', '2025-06-12 16:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166637006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, '6-12-25 Steve is turning 63 7/25/25 and his wife is 60 now 10/9/64. He has ins now but he''s paying $2K per month for family of 4. He''s going to move his 2 adult kids off the plan. Son is turning 26 in Oct. Both kids are getting married. He''s self-employed. Used to work in the hospital system and quit after seeing how corrupt it''s become. He knows the games with coding, etc. He and his wife are healthy, no tobacco. Steve takes Lisinopril as preventive for blood pressure maintenance. Wife has an inhaler that she never uses for adult onset asthma. Yes, his wife wants to do the wellness screenings and keep her NP Ann Watson with Owensboro Health Women''s Clinic. Their site doesn''t show any health ins information anywhere that I can find. Steve will find out if she''s in the PHCS/Multi-Plan network. Steve  has no interest in doing another colonoscopy any time soon. He did one about 5 years ago, I think. This is where he was the corrupt coding practices.  He wants me to use his work email instead of his other email that''s riddled with spam now. His work email is the one I put in above. He''s looking for an Aug. 1st start date. We have the next appt set for June 25th to enroll for Aug. He looked at Medishare but Suzy Martinek is his sister and she highly recommends this. I quoted Premium HSA due to age and wellness desires.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-12 15:44:32', '2025-06-12 15:45:53'),
