  ('zcrm_1579374000166592042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155940022', 'Jeffrey Hamlin', NULL, 'texted Correta the following info 
To proceed, we kindly ask that the client contact their doctor and have a prescription faxed to us at 407-949-6724. We will only need the client’s name and phone number, so we can notify them once the prescription has been received.

Please note that all pricing remains the same as previously quoted—there are no changes.

Additionally, while there are still ongoing issues with the Canadian Postal Service, orders are continuing to ship. However, pharmacies are processing shipments with the understanding that they will not be held financially responsible if delays occur due to any postal work stoppages.

Thank you for your attention to this matter. Please let me know if you have any questions.

Best regards,', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 13:31:36', '2025-06-11 13:31:36'),
