  ('zcrm_1579374000166588489', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128237002', 'Ronald DeLegge', NULL, '6/11/25: Ronald called needing help with a lab bill his wife just received from labcorp. She has rheumatoid arthritis and had some labs done - they paid the cash rate of $1400 at date of service, but then labcorp did extra labs and sent them another bill for an additional $1500 without any authorization for the additional labs. Ronald is sending bill and order to concierge email for us to take a look. Let him know I''d get back with him tomorrow and we''d do whatever we can to help. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 13:25:23', '2025-06-11 13:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166573125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '06/11/2025
