  ('zcrm_1579374000166593007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '6-11-25 Anna has a colonoscopy scheduled and wants to know how to go about it. She thinks she might have missed her deadline to do so. She was on PDHC it looks like. Redirect is extended through June. May be able to do it that way. Or, she can wait 6 months and do it through Sedera and then HAB as backup if cost exceeds $2500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-11 12:19:18', '2025-06-11 12:19:18'),
