  ('zcrm_1579374000166588283', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155284019', 'Stephen Rawleigh', NULL, '6/11/25: Stephen called asking about prescription benefits. I let him know about the concierge service for getting the price down. He already gets it through costplus but just wanted to check in case he could run it through his plan. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 12:12:53', '2025-06-11 12:12:53'),
