  ('zcrm_1579374000166572007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, 'This member called in and told me that he had just had a cancer screening that amounted to just under $1000.  I asked if there would be any further treatment required, and he said no.   I advised him that the bill would be his responsibility.  He also had called Planstin and was told that he no longer had coverage with them.  I told him about the ARM transition.  He also needs to submit Change From to update his address as he never received his ARM Cards', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-11 12:06:34', '2025-06-11 12:06:34'),
