  ('zcrm_1579374000166588130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '6/11/25; Suzy called wondering if she should go to her virtual dr appt tomorrow or use Cirrus - what''s included in her plan? I let her know that Cirrus is always a great place to start bc it is free to use whenever as it''s part of her plan. She also asked if she can use that for mental health. I let her know that they can assist with some mental health issues in the short term, but to access her therapy benefits, she would use MSEAP. She already had their number in her phone and knew how to do that. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 11:49:39', '2025-06-11 11:49:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154953001', 'David Byrne', NULL, '6/11/25: Send Lenissa FU email for sharing request to check and see if everything has been approved. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 11:26:54', '2025-06-11 11:26:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134764002', 'Nathan Rivera', NULL, '6/11/25: Nathan called and asked the procedure for seeing a specialist - he has a cyst on his hand. I let him know that there is no network or referral process unless the provider requires it, however if he''d like us to research hand specialists in his area, we can do that. He said he already had someone in mind. We also discussed his IUA and the difference between that and a deductible. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 11:24:25', '2025-06-11 11:24:25'),
