-Western Mtn Surgeons, Dr. Kevin Rails, Jessica, 702-796-0022.

Put a note in for Monday - maybe rush Zion if they are able to get estimate this week...', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 11:02:56', '2025-06-11 16:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156437001', 'Zachery Poulter', NULL, '6/11/25: Called to FU with Rebecca to check and see how telehealth appt went. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 11:00:28', '2025-06-11 11:00:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '6/11/25: Called to FU with Jennifer regarding colo surgeon options. She said she''s been out of town traveling and will take a look at what I sent over today and give me a call back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 10:49:00', '2025-06-11 10:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785001', 'Piotr Kaczmarowski', NULL, '6/11/25: Piotr emailed in asking why his colo bills are not $0 - it looks like they were reduced down to $144, which is good considering something was sent to pathology. Forwarded email to Lori for the exact reasoning and will reach back out to him when I learn more. 

Lori responded: We had a staff meeting with the claims department and determined that Piotr should not have any out of pocket for the Pathology charge because the provider resubmitted his claim and put a Z code on the “corrected” claim.
We will reconsider and pay.  Thank you Karen for reprocessing.

Emailed Piotr and let him know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 10:39:37', '2025-06-11 15:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166532293', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097899002', 'Amy Jones', NULL, 'Spoke to member we needed to reschedule welcome call because our website was temporarily unavailable as we perform updates. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 10:39:03', '2025-06-11 10:39:03'),
