  ('zcrm_1579374000166587020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '06.11.25 - Rachel wanted to know if she had to wait for the medical need to be "over" in order to submit the bills to Zion. Advised that she can submit as she goes. Also choose any provider as there is no network. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-11 10:28:18', '2025-06-11 10:28:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166588001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046884055', 'Tracy Roye', NULL, '6/11/25: Franklin called asking if their plan has prescription benefits. Yes- explained them. He also stated they never got their card. (called Dave and requested another be sent). He wanted to know how exactly the direct plan would pair with a DPC dr. Other than explaining the benefit differences, I wasn''t able to give a complete answer. Having Adam reach out to him today since his advisor is John Kach. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-11 10:27:55', '2025-06-11 10:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166587001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '06.11.25 - Felicia was at the pharmacy and needed help downloading the health wallet. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-11 10:20:01', '2025-06-11 10:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166533037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135183021', 'Larissa Brice', NULL, 'Per Dayra this member was charged the incorrect Share Amount upon enrolling due to the fact that he was not yet 50 when he enrolled, however turned 50 in 6/25.  I will charge him the extra $145 and change Share Amount for next month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-11 09:59:27', '2025-06-11 09:59:27'),
