  ('zcrm_1579374000166488073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '06/10/2025
Philip called and left a VMm about being in collections now. Called him back and he told me about how he thought he read somewhere that Zion had paid the bill so he does not know how he is in collections now for it. He is going to talk to his wife and log in to his portal and see what zion has written by the need and see if the status can tell us something. From there i told him to call me back and we can all call Zion together to double check on this bill to see if it is paid or not.

Edit: he called back and said Zion has not paid anything. We will call them in the morning of 06/11/2025 to find out what is going on with his need. 
