  ('zcrm_1579374000166366027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '6/9/25: Emailed Jennifer 3 top choices for colon surgeons and facilities near her. Based on our conversations, I''ll wait till she chooses a provider before moving forward with scheduling the appt. AM 

Appt Scheduling Research - Starting with Hoag Digestive, William Oh MD - (949) 557-0370
They confirmed they are in PHCS network, however, they do need to speak to patient directly before they''ll book an appointment and require notes from a previous dr visit - but not necessarily a referral.

Another Hoag Dr with great reviews: Elizabeth Raskin MD, (949) 557-0251
Will have same appt setting stipulations as Oh. 
https://www.hoag.org/physician/elizabeth-r-raskin-md/

Newport Irvine Surgical Specialists: Rad, Babak, N,M.D. - (949) 791-6767 
Both facility and dr have great reviews. The office was not sure about PHCS network, however the dr is contracted. She mentioned they bill with group NPI number, and not individual surgeons, and to schedule an appt the member would need to schedule an office consultation first. First available opening is mid July. 
https://newportirvinesurgicalspecialists.com/surgeons/babak-rad-m-d-facs', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-09 07:57:00', '2025-06-09 10:40:26'),
