  ('zcrm_1579374000166292008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '6-6-25 Sara decided she wants Kaiser since they may not go to Thailand. She likes how Kaiser''s system works with a team of doctors. Cobra will cost about $2100.  Her new self-employed business isn''t set up yet.  Her best estimate for her income moving forward and annualized will be about $50K plus Jantinee''s investment income of $8800 makes her best guess at $58,800. That gives them a $1077.95 APTC. She knows if her income is looking to be better then she will update the income and the APTC will change. This gives them a $1077.95 APTC. She can choose a KP Colorado Option Gold for $620.42 her cost.  She couldn''t log into her C4 account. She''ll call C4 and get into her account, choose the plan and set up payment. She knows that she needs to show proof of SEP with Cobra notice. She doesn''t have the letter yet but will be able to get it soon.  She needs a July 1st start date. She was super appreciative!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-06 09:39:45', '2025-06-06 09:39:45'),
