  ('zcrm_1579374000166291001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220001', 'Esther Gryder', NULL, 'Member called in with many questions.  She has in addition to the Care + membership a Concierge Doc who she uses for Preventative care.  She also had a Optimum Rx plan thru a service called nipper.  I assured her that that was not thru us and that I had no information.  I explained what she has thru us and she admitted that she needed to be more informed of what she has.  What she wants is a PDF of what she has.  I encouraged her to do a welcome call as it looks like she has never done one in the 5 yrs she has been a member.  I will see what I can find her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-06 09:21:39', '2025-06-06 09:21:39'),
