  ('zcrm_1579374000166236021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166203007', 'Jason Matouk', NULL, '06.05.25:  Recvd. an email from Jason. Said he was enrolling and waited to long and the time expired for him to put in the code to wave the enrollment fee. I responded and told him to cancel out that application and re-do it. If that didn''t work I could send him an invite to share the Teams screen with me and I could see what he is filling out. He said he''d try it on his lap top. A few minutes later I recvd. a confirmation of enrollment submission from MPB for a July 1, 2025 start date. I emailed Jason to confirm this w/him. I mentioned he will be receiving several more emails to instruct him during his membership onboarding and to contact me with any questions. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-06-05 15:39:00', '2025-06-05 15:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166236016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166203007', 'Jason Matouk', NULL, '05.30.25:  Called Jason. No pre-x; healthy; no meds.  Explained Care Plus - recommended this plan as Jason said he''s just looking for a plan that protects against large medical needs. Wants to enroll himself. Gave him the $100 waver code. Told him to text or email me and let me know when he completes enrollment and to call me w/any questions. Emailed Jason to repeat instructions for enrolling. Told him start date is 7/1/25. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-06-05 15:32:08', '2025-06-05 15:32:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166236011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166203007', 'Jason Matouk', NULL, '05.29.25:  Emailed Jason. Asked if 10 a.m. on Friday would work for me to call him. He replied yes. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-06-05 15:29:17', '2025-06-05 15:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166236006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166203007', 'Jason Matouk', NULL, '05.28.25:  Recvd. an email from Denise re: son, Jason. She wants $100 enrollment fee waived and an $1000 IUA. Jason''s phone #:  954-224-8106; email: jasonmatouk@gmail.com. Emailed Denise &amp; Jason. Asked him to contact me to schedule a call re: plan selection. Gave him a few dates to choose. He responded Friday would work. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-06-05 15:28:35', '2025-06-05 15:28:35'),
