  ('zcrm_1579374000166200440', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105086010', 'Ben Rego', NULL, '6/5/25: Ben called needing some advice on navigating his need. He''s been to several doctors to try and figure out an issue and it ended up being a tumor on his kidney and is having surgery tomorrow. He has bills equalling about 2K at the moment. I recommended he go ahead and open his sharing request. He was already in portal and I guided him on how to start, documentation he needs and things to be aware of such as 6 month deadline, what''s considered part of request, pre-ex clause and phase in period just in case. Set a task to check on Ben in 2 weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-05 12:03:00', '2025-06-05 12:03:00'),
