  ('zcrm_1579374000166153071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163661002', 'Conna Tigges', NULL, '06.04.25 Conna left a VM inquiring about the start of her membership. Sent and email with a link to schedule a WC. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-04 12:19:50', '2025-06-04 12:19:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166153050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134978019', 'Angel Cachero', NULL, '06.04.25 - Angel had a miscarriage in May. Since her IUA was still 5000 change to 1000 60 day clause, the bills would still be her personal financial responsibility. She is working with the hospital to reduce them down. Advised to submit to Zion anyway to see if their bill negotiation team can work on reducing the costs. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-04 12:11:55', '2025-06-04 12:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166115425', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659263', 'Julie Sombrio', NULL, '6/4/25: Julie called, she was at the provider''s office and couldn''t find her card. I let her know she can access the digital version of her card through Health Wallet app and sent her link to access. She also mentioned concern about the referral process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 12:01:17', '2025-06-04 12:01:17'),
