  ('zcrm_1579374000166115412', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '6/4/25: Called to check up on Andrea. She said she was able to get in touch with the provider and have them resubmit the bill. She said everything is good. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 10:31:03', '2025-06-04 10:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166153001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163370002', 'Michael Collie', NULL, 'Michael called to obtain his policy number to schedule a colonoscopy. The only way for me to obtain that was by logging into his HealthWallet App with his permission. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-04 10:24:19', '2025-06-04 10:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166115405', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '6/4/25: Ruth called needing to get a tetanus shot. Her dr outsources this through a provider that ARM could not verify. She asked if she could just go to the pharmacy...I replied, yes she should be able to do that. And if for some reason she ends up paying for it, call back and we can help with a reimbursement. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 10:22:30', '2025-06-04 10:22:30'),
