  ('zcrm_1579374000166115032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '6/4/25: Kimberly emailed in asking what to do about a mamm bill that was sent to planstin. Advised her to have bill resubmitted to ARM. She also asked when to use ARM versus Zion - I explained that...
If the visit is preventive such as a screening mammogram , wellness checkup, well-woman visit, or screening colonoscopy – then it gets billed to ARM. (preventive only)
 If the visit is a large medical issue that you expect to go over your IUA amount, then it is submitted to Zion.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 07:31:50', '2025-06-04 07:31:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166111049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Refresher Welcome call complete. She will check to see if she has their QR life code cards if not she will contact Concierge. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 07:30:14', '2025-06-04 07:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166115027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159690002', 'Casey McGriff', NULL, '6/4/25: Sarah got back to me regarding Casey''s med: 
