-Will give it a little time and reach out to Casey tomorrow to make sure everything is resolved. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 07:24:09', '2025-06-04 07:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166115008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '6/4/25: Emailed Leslie letting her know that their accounts have been corrected and they should have all received emails to complete registration. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-04 07:20:36', '2025-06-04 07:20:36'),
