  ('zcrm_1579374000166113001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142370033', 'Michael Llerandi', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse eff 7/25 due to divorce.  I will process &amp; inform Sedera of this change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-04 06:46:53', '2025-06-04 06:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166091016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130717010', 'Dalton Fisher', NULL, 'Address update form. Sarah also needed to open a need for Maternity but didnt have time to do it now. Gave her the number for Zion for future reference. - LM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-03 16:12:45', '2025-06-03 16:12:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166049026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '6-3-25 Ricki called bc he got emails from Sedera welcoming him and stating a 7-1-25 effective date which is wrong. He needs the 6-1-25 effective date and the original start date was 2-1-2020. There should be no lapse in his membership. He''s forwarding me the emails for me to forward along to get corrected.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-03 16:11:12', '2025-06-03 16:11:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166091009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156134012', 'Sheryl Hunter', NULL, 'Sherly needed assistance opening up a need for a gul bladder surgery. She had never opened up a need before. We called Zion and spoke to Abby who helped us open a need and explained the process. - LM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-03 16:05:08', '2025-06-03 16:05:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166049021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166676002', 'Cecilia DeLise', NULL, '6-3-25 Cecelia watched the video. She just turned 64. She''s planning to leave her job any day now and wants a July 1st start date. She''s only paying about $300 now her medical, dental, vision which includes her 78 yr old husband! Clearly her company is paying most of the cost. I will connect them to Andrea and Alyssa for Medicare. Cecelia is most interested in Premium HSA $363/$1000 and wants to fund the HSA and use the wellness. She knows Valley View is out of network. She can still try to use ARM and allow them to negotiate the rates. She goes to Dr. Spence.  She already did her mammogram and colonoscopy this year and they were fine. She takes 10 mg as preventive of atorvastatin. She also takes estradiol. Otherwise, no other pre-x, no tobacco. She wants Delta Dental Clear Plan for dental and will go to Mountain Family Health Centers to be in network for Delta Dental.  She''s currently going to Snowmass Village Dental but they don''t accept any insurance, so will change. Delta Dental is about $63 per month which she prefers over the discount plan and over Spirit dental. She also wants VSP to include yearly glasses.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-03 15:43:35', '2025-06-03 15:43:35'),
