  ('zcrm_1579374000166040230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, 'Member called into to me and advised that she is having some financial problems and wanted other options to lower her Share Amount.  Also advised that she was given Jeffrey''s phone number to contact and he was not happy.  She will be switching to the Premium Care membership $2500 IUA to save money.  I sent out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-03 14:28:17', '2025-06-03 14:28:17'),
