  ('zcrm_1579374000166049011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163846068', 'Mark Reinhard', NULL, '6-3-25 Due to high income and assets, I ran the illustrations at 10X income making it $1.5M and $2M. He''s leaning towards $2M and paying quarterly or semi-annually. THIA will pay $25 towards the policy every month. Aiming for July 1st start date. Only med is for high blood pressure, otherwise solid family history but doesn''t know dad''s health history.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-03 11:28:54', '2025-06-03 11:28:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166049006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163846068', 'Mark Reinhard', NULL, '4-16-25 "You asked about assets and monthly expenses, we roughly have around $900k in assets and $1500 in monthly expenses. Please let me know if you have any questions."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-03 11:26:00', '2025-06-03 11:26:00'),
