  ('zcrm_1579374000166041413', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072553056', 'Jason Naumann', NULL, '6/3/25: Angela called. She has a prev bill from Jan. that the provider sent to (planstin I think) and now she''s getting billed. I explained that she would need to call provider and have them resubmit the bill to ARM. She said that bc it''s been so long, she didn''t think they would accept it and it''s about to be sent to collections. I advised her to send the bill to concierge email, and I''d get it to ARM and follow up with her after I speak to them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-03 10:50:30', '2025-06-03 10:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166041387', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129622001', 'Sarah Hildreth', NULL, '6/3/25: Sarah was transferred to us from Planstin. She was irritated that her plan had been "changed to us" and she didn''t know it and she has a preventive bill from January that was sent to Planstin. I explained that her plan has always been with MPB, and there was a change to the vendor but she should have received new cards in the mail. She was able to locate the new card while we were talking and is going to call provider to have them resubmit. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-03 10:37:10', '2025-06-03 10:37:10'),
