  ('zcrm_1579374000165999074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165999021', 'Lisa McKell', NULL, '5-30-25 Lisa came to me via Hannah Blatter. The company they work for lost their health ins. It was supposed to be only for one month but they aren''t convinced it won''t be for longer. They are thinking the company might go belly up. Lisa called just in time to get June 1st start date. They also lost her husbands ins and Cobra is available from that avenue. She can use either Cobra letter for proof of SEP. She chose the Cigna Connect Flext Bronze 0 and I gave her instructions to submit the document for SEP via email. She enrolled successfully on her own. I also let her know about how and when to pay for ongoing payments, etc.  Also, Lisa and husband have 3 kids. The youngest, Maria is on Medicaid also bc she has autism. She is a fraternal twin and Louis does not have autism. They are getting about a $543 APTC since her husband is currently w/o a job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-06-02 12:36:48', '2025-06-02 12:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000166002006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159250002', 'Lexi Baldwin', NULL, '06.02.25 - Lexi needed a proof of benefits for her school. Provided her with a member handbook, the card within health wallet and will send proof of membership letter. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-06-02 12:28:49', '2025-06-02 12:28:49'),
