  ('zcrm_1579374000165966381', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122077', 'Angela Smith', NULL, '6/2/25: Angela submitted RX quote request, however the dosage she listed for NP Thyroid is not showing up as an option on any of the sites. Sent her an email to ask. Also called, LVM. If I don''t hear back soon, I''ll go ahead and send without NP thryoid. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 11:40:25', '2025-06-03 07:58:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165966376', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120678002', 'Michael Hand', NULL, '6/2/25: Michael called. He got double billed for a CT scan from the hospital and wanted to know if that''s something we typically handle or should he call up there. I let him know it''s not something we typically handle and suggested he call  and just let them know they double billed him. He was fine with that, said he doesn''t mind at all - just wanted to make sure. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 11:36:03', '2025-06-02 11:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165965097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, 'Member called in and was unsure why Planstin was denying her preventative office visit.  I advised her that she had the Direct membership and that she had limited benefit around Preventative.  Member made this Change in 10/22.  She did not remember this and asked pricing around making the Change back to Secure.  She said that it was a wash and that she would think further about ti.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-06-02 11:34:21', '2025-06-02 11:34:21'),
