  ('zcrm_1579374000165966092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107483002', 'Mario Perkins', NULL, '6/2/25: Mildred called needing help accessing her telehealth - she was pretty sick. Got her into HW app and started on an urgent care appt. She also asked what if she has to go to an appt in person, let her know it would be no network and she would present as self pay. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 08:39:06', '2025-06-02 08:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165966073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '6/2/25:  Called Digestive Health back - they LVM regarding a screening colo for Bruce. Let them know as long as it''s screening, his plan will pay for it and claims info is on this card. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 08:34:43', '2025-06-02 08:34:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165966068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '6/2/25: Leslie called. She''s having issues with telehealth. I think they registered her husband with her email. I explained that everyone in her family will have their own account (with a unique email) since everyone is over 18. Once Leslie provides me Tom''s email, I''ll put in a support ticket to get it sorted out. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 08:19:47', '2025-06-02 08:19:47'),
