- sent review link just in case she''d like to share any feedback. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 07:31:09', '2025-06-02 07:31:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165966034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123644002', 'Shane Patterson', NULL, '6/2/25: Shane emailed in asking the turnaround time for claim processing by ARM. Let him know about a week. 2 at the latest and offered to call and check on his claim. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-06-02 07:26:11', '2025-06-02 07:26:11'),
