  ('zcrm_1579374000165899001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, '05.30.25 - Daniel called stating that he was able to get a coupon for his injections through the manufacturer. It worked for the first 3 months. Now he just had a refill, and was charged $600 because the "insurance" name he provided did not pay for their portion (even if it''s $1 as he said). Connected to Zion, if Zion does not work, will have to see if RX Valet/ARM will be able to cover. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-05-30 11:23:29', '2025-05-30 11:23:29'),
