  ('zcrm_1579374000165822020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, '05.29.25 - Troy called wanting to open his first sharing request for his wife Karen. She experienced some lung issues and is still in the diagnostic phase. Explained the IUA and advised to obtain the super bill from urgent care to upload. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-05-29 14:41:25', '2025-05-29 14:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165849014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '5-29-25 I left a vm for Liz to let her know that her Redirect membership is going to be active through June 30th. That was correct. She gets the benefit of an overlap with the new and current membership. This will give her time to finish out her visits with Redirect. She is in the middle of doing Cologuard that they are sending to her. MPB is NOT charging her the extra cost for Redirect for the month of June. So, she actually gets the best of both worlds. I''m finally able to give her good news.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-29 14:20:32', '2025-05-29 14:20:32'),
