  ('zcrm_1579374000165849006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '5-29-25 Ryan called to find out if it would be a good idea to choose the HMA Platinum. He was wanting his dental bill reimbursed 100%. It should be since his dentist went through the process to become in-network. They handled it like it was out of network. He will contact them now. If he has trouble getting answers, I told him to send me an email I''ll forward it to my contact person. He was super appreciative. He''s also asking about CO bc he wants to move here with his fiance. He used to live in BV, grew up in SoCal and likes Durango. The heat of TX is getting to him now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-29 12:21:26', '2025-05-29 12:21:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165849001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '5-29-25 I helped Karl fill out the cancellation form. His benefits will begin June 1st through his new job. I let him know that is he cancels Health Access he''ll never be able to re-enroll. If he wants to make use of his mental health therapists he will lose that benefit. He wasn''t sure if he''ll be doing that or not. But will decide. He''ll also get reimbursed for playing hockey. He will let me know by tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-29 12:00:00', '2025-05-29 12:00:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165802435', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129819012', 'Bryce Roberts', NULL, '5/29/25: Hospital called to check Lucas eligibility. Informed that he is active and start date. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-29 11:44:00', '2025-05-29 11:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165801140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138111002', 'Kristen Garcia', NULL, 'Member called in and left a VM asking about cancellation.  I sent her out the link and advised her of the deadline.  Copied advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-29 11:21:35', '2025-05-29 11:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165817088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165277002', 'Cody Slevin', NULL, 'Tried phone number on file and call just disconnects. Sent email to member to reschedule welcome call after start date of June 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-29 11:06:00', '2025-05-29 11:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165801130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 6/26 due to the fact that he will now have employer benefits.  I will process &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-29 11:02:56', '2025-05-29 11:02:56'),
