  ('zcrm_1579374000165802422', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141795002', 'Stephen Hillmer', NULL, '5/29/25: Stephen called from the ER. At first questioning what card is current, we discussed which one he needed to keep and why. Then the fact that he needed to open a sharing request for the issue at hand. He was having chest pain and ended up having 3 blockages so they put a stint in. He''s also seen a cardiologist and had some meds prescribed. It appears that the providers have been running his bills through ARM. I advised him to present as self pay moving forward, to collect itemized receipts and how to open a sharing request. Offered to connect with Sedera to go ahead and open it. Him and his wife would like to collect what bills they have so far and will call back in a day or so. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-29 10:52:56', '2025-05-29 10:53:08'),
