  ('zcrm_1579374000165741023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '5-28-25 Brandi is considering adding Cloud Medical to her quiver and after chatting it looks like it would be best to drop MEC. She won''t do a mammo. Dr. Tusek prefers thermography not mammo! She''s not old enough for a colonoscopy since she''s 43 and no intention of going any time soon. She''s interested in changing her IUA from $1000 to $2500 as well. I showed her how and where to complete the Change Form to move from Secure HSA to Care+ and increase IUA. Her total cost wil lbe $205/$2500 plus $139 Cloud - $344. She''s paying $336 now and will get more assistance from Cloud. She also knows to use Concierge to get labs at best price and for 30% discount on supplments. She''s excited to get the supplements for a greater discount. She''s getting a 25% discount already but 30% will be great!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-28 12:24:53', '2025-05-28 12:24:53'),
