  ('zcrm_1579374000165736040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142602002', 'Steve Feld', NULL, '5/28/25: Steve called wanting to cancel. I provided him the form and also asked if he had any open sharing requests..he said he thinks they closed them all out - and it didn''t matter because they were denying everything anyway. He gave a little info, that it was a back injury and that Sedera sent some notices but in the emails stated if they didn''t hear from him, they''d be closing the request, which according to Steve - they did. 
