  ('zcrm_1579374000165645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159767002', 'Pamela Skop', '5/27/25 Ac', 'Pamela called regarding an Rx discount she received previously, possibly through a former insurance provider. She expected assistance in resolving it.I advised Pamela to download the Health Wallet app to view participating pharmacies and check the formulary.Asked if she had presented her new insurance card at the pharmacy; she stated she has never presented any card.Instructed her to provide the pharmacy with her new card that includes Rx Valet information. Emailed her the new welcome letter along with the link to download the Health Wallet app.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-27 12:34:06', '2025-05-27 12:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '5-27-25 Val is needing to remove Fletcher from the family membership bc they finalized a divorce on 5-20-25. She''s already paid for June. Their monthly EF is $2500/$843. Fletcher is 52. Therefore, MO is $369 at the $2500 IUA. He will need to reimburse Val for the month of June. We can get him re-enrolled for July 1st with his original start date of Aug. 1st, 2020. Val''s cost will decrease to $2500/$488 I believe for the current Secure HSA pricing. I need to reach out to Fletcher to get him re-enrolled for July 1st. Val will take care of the kids herself. Sounds like Fletcher won''t be chipping in at all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-27 12:15:47', '2025-05-27 12:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165591171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163494001', 'Angela Carroll', NULL, 'Member now realizes that she has a Pre-Ex and now wants to cancel prior to start date.  I will process her refund &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-27 12:11:35', '2025-05-27 12:11:35'),
