  ('zcrm_1579374000165601212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '5/27/25: Samuel called. He has a PCP appt August 1 and has questions about how to handle it. He has a liver condition and has to get blood work and an ultrasound 4x/year. He already has order for labs that were sent to Quest. I advised him to fill out lab quote request form and upload order so we can pull a quote for him. 
He''s wondering how to manage med - Tenofovir - let him know I''d ask if it''s something that can be managed through virtual pcp (will ask during lyric meeting tomorrow) If not, then he''ll have to see an in person dr to write the scripts. We also discussed his ultrasound (of liver). I gave him a quick quote over the phone from radiology assist, but he may need a referral for that - also a question I''ll ask Lyric. 
We talked about why this bloodwork and us wouldn''t be considered a covered preventive service, but I also gave him ARM''s contact info if he wanted to discuss it further with them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-27 11:49:12', '2025-05-27 11:49:12'),
