  ('zcrm_1579374000165458169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '5-23-25 Julie called bc she needs to show proof of ins for a work visa for Europe for a few months and for her son who''s going to UNH. She might add MEC ARM and see if that will work for both purposes. UNH looks strict about MCS but not sure about MEC. Combo of MCS and MEC looks to cover what UNH states the plan must include. She''s paying $558 Premium Care $1000 EC and could change to Premium HSA $676 $1000 for July 1st effective. She''ll let me know before June 19th. She loves HAB and wants to offer it to her employee/s Deatra Jones Dixon but it''s too late. She''s bummed about that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-23 12:07:56', '2025-05-23 12:07:56'),
