  ('zcrm_1579374000165448001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151922012', 'Mary Grace Del A Torre Erickson', NULL, '5/23/25: Member''s advisor DeBora called in saying that Mary Grace is having issue with providers "accepting her plan" DeBora mentioned she''s trying to see someone about her thyroid and they are telling her she needs a referral and they don''t accept her coverage. I explained the possible things that may be going on here, but most likely it''s how she''s presenting herself and advised DeBora to have her call us, or even the provider can call us - also, we can schedule the appointment for her if she likes. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-23 07:20:20', '2025-05-23 07:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165432031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165434002', 'Parson Hicks', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-23 07:08:23', '2025-05-23 07:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165338205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-22-25 Ricki called to inquire about how to handle a hernia he has that he got from doing a tough abs workout! He wants to do it in CA rather than in Aspen. He can get into a Dr. in CA in Oct. He doesn''t want to ruin his summer in Aspen from having a surgery before that. I suggested that he reaches out to Sedera to see what their best advice is. Aspen is usually super expensive, so they may prefer to allow him to do the surgery in CA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-22 16:45:52', '2025-05-22 16:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165338200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158795002', 'Deatra Jones-Dixon', NULL, '5-22-25 She''s all set. She left me a vm to get into her portal and the Concierge was able to help her earlier today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-22 16:34:31', '2025-05-22 16:34:31'),
