  ('zcrm_1579374000165338190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '5-21-25 Sara called bc she''s looking to leave her place of employment next week. She''s not sure how quickly her benefits will end. She can use Cobra if need be. She''s planning to work on her own private practice and may also travel in Thailand for a bit with her family. She would want to be covered while abroad. She''s 51 and her wife is 55 or 56 and son is 14. She has a vax induced shoulder injury and a thyroid issue. She likes Kaiser and will choose that if they don''t travel to Thailand. If they do go to Thailand she''s open to MCS possibly. She will watch the video before we talk next on June 6th. She''s earning about $50K now but her income will be varied once she''s on her own and will likely be less to get started.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-21 16:27:28', '2025-05-21 16:27:28'),
