  ('zcrm_1579374000165338037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165356015', 'Wendy Mesa', NULL, '5-20-25 Wendy was Bev''s client and lives in Montrose. She''s been with her partner for 16 years and had always filed taxes as filed separately. But, her accountant told her to filled as married filing jointly since they bought a house together 5 years ago and they bought a farm together recently as well. However, they don''t have any SEP since none of this was done recently. So, I can''t see how to make a change bc no proof of a change to report to C4. She''s paying $474 or so and her income was $72K and will increase to $110K with her partner. His employer, Mattress Firm gives him health insurance and offers her the opportunity to join. Although, one year when she tried to join they wanted proof of marriage which they don''t have. They did not get anything notarized as Common Law. She had no idea that was even possible.  Her accountant told her they need to combine their accounts as married filing jointly, otherwise she will face a large tax penalty. To avoid all of that, she chose to join Premium HSA. She''s self employed. She has a heart thing that she takes metropolol for. I said at least 10X to make sure she''s not concerned of a heart issue in the first year and through the end of the 3rd year. I told her to call her dr. and make sure he has no concerns of a bigger problem. She''s not concerned at all and talked with her partner and is awaiting a call back from her dr. But, she''s very excited to join Premium HSA for June 1st $1000/$363. We went ahead and cancelled her RMHP for May 31st. I told her to call RMHP to cancel her auto payment as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-20 16:18:29', '2025-05-20 16:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165361048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153594001', 'Dayton Skrivseth', NULL, '5/20/25
Juday called wanting to know where to pick up her semiglutide prescription, I guided her through the health wallet, I could not guide her any further because she did not have her script on and. And i advised her it was important to input precis information on the HW app to obtain accurate info for prescriptions AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-20 16:17:56', '2025-05-20 16:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165361043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140492002', 'Christopher Hawkins', NULL, '5/20/25
