  ('zcrm_1579374000165361038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151633002', 'Kristen LaPrade', NULL, '5/20/25
Sent cancelation link per members request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-20 16:14:18', '2025-05-20 16:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000165338016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '5-20-25 Laura is vacillating between Medicaid and MCS. She''s working on a new business and not earning money right now but hoping to in a few months. People keep telling her to join Medicaid.  She''s finally reaching the point to maintain her membership with Secure HSA with her original start date Dec. 1st, 2020 with Dechen Hawk. Now getting divorced and needing to separate their membership. She didn''t want to start the pre-x clause all over again just in case. Not really worried about pre-x but it can still get people in trouble. So, she also has pap screening soon and decided to keep the ARM MEC for this and to spread out her money. $1000/$336 EO as self-employed.  Her original start date was Dec. 1st 2020 with her current membership.  All set. Doesn''t really want to use CirrusMD, but wants to new ARM card. She may have to update her address again soon bc they just sold the place she''s renting.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-20 15:32:08', '2025-05-20 15:58:59');
