  ('zcrm_1579374000165292034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, 'Larua is going through a very stressful situation. Starting with her provider attempting to bill ARM even though she insisted she was a self-pay. They said they had to bill ARM which arm denied as this for injections of Evenity, a very expensive drug. She opened a need with Zion but Zion denied. She filed an appeal, at the same time she was working with Amgen the creators of Evenity, to help. Zion now got back to her letting her know that they would only pay for Evenity and everything else associated to the Osteoporosis would be out of pocket by her. 

She also let me know that Zion quote "Under the table" told her she could save money by going directly through Zion without us. Angela Sweet is the Zion Advocate.

She is now wondering what she should do, if she should continue with the Foundation, should she use the Zion funds to pay for Evenity etc. I told her she should use the Zion funds to pay for the injection but also continue with the Foundation. I also told her I would connect with higher ups to see if there is another or better route to take. Scheduled a follow up for tomorrow 9:30 AM her time (California) - LM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-19 18:27:40', '2025-05-19 18:36:08'),
