Based on the date of appt, Shelley has until June 9th to ask for a reimbursement from Planstin. Both myself and William agreed this would be the safest route. Shelley is going to reach out to Dr. today and get cash rate + superbill with CPT codes and email them to us and claims@planstin.com - I put a task for Monday to check on Shelley and make sure bill gets into Planstin''s hands before deadline. 
