  ('zcrm_1579374000164972139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156134012', 'Sheryl Hunter', NULL, '5/14/25: Sheryl emailed in unable to access her Zion RX share account. Let her know she''d have to contact Zion directly for this or use their chat feature. Provided contact info. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-14 10:40:10', '2025-05-14 10:40:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164972118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919234', 'Casey Hebb', NULL, '5/14/25: Lori emailed in letting us know that Casey''s mail is being returned. I reached out to Casey, left a voice message and sent email asking if her address has changed and provided form to update just in case. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-14 10:34:17', '2025-05-14 10:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164972097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157224002', 'Timothy Craig', NULL, '5/14/25: Sent RX quote via email:
