AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-14 10:23:38', '2025-05-14 10:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164972076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134764002', 'Nathan Rivera', NULL, '5/14/25: Nathan called. His colonoscopy is going to be a diagnostic procedure and wondering next steps. I explained his IUA, how to set up sharing request, what to collect and connected to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-14 10:17:06', '2025-05-14 10:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164972066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, '5/14/25: Susan called in wondering if an annual would also be covered by her plan even though she already had a visit with her OBGYN. I explained that yes - the obgyn visit would be considered her well-woman visit and the annual with a pcp is a general wellness visit. And that essentially, anything the dr deems necessary as part of his/her usualy protocol for that type of visit is paid for as long as it''s coded preventive. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-14 10:09:13', '2025-05-14 10:09:13'),
