  ('zcrm_1579374000164824044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158979002', 'Mollie Roth', '5/12/25', 'Moliie chaed with us and  i informed her of the following  since you''re part of a health share program, it works a bit differently from traditional insurance. In order for the health share to begin sharing in your medical expenses, you first need to meet your Initial Unshareable Amount (IUA) of $1,000 toward a single medical condition.
