  ('zcrm_1579374000164761042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158979002', 'Mollie Roth', NULL, 'I received an email from Sedera responding to this member who ask them to be cancelled eff 6/30.  I responded to them that she had submitted a cancellation to us on 5/6 requesting a 5/31 cancellation that was already processed. I advised her that I would have to know prior to the 19th is she wanted to extend her membership until 6/30.  She then emailed me back and told me that she was unaware that she had to have more expenses that $1000 to be reimbursed.  Another member that didn''t get any education therefore didn''t know how the membership worked.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-12 14:05:29', '2025-05-12 14:05:29'),
