  ('zcrm_1579374000164586034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110548018', 'AMY PAGENKOPH', NULL, 'On 4/30 spouse of member called in and asked for an extension until 5/2, since they had some fraud on their account and were waiting on new Credit Cards.  He talked about going direct with Zion for less money.  In the interest of saving the member I relented.  However, I have not received any communication from member.  I called advisor Jerry Webber who is members Uncle, and he tried to contact member.  He checked in with me and let me know that he was having trouble contacting member.  I will be cancelling this member for non payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-08 08:18:22', '2025-05-08 08:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164586024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154387002', 'Jeanne Kinkade-Moses', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-08 08:05:24', '2025-05-08 08:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164586019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154387002', 'Jeanne Kinkade-Moses', NULL, 'Member has submitted Change form to increase her IUA to $5000 eff 6/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-08 08:04:54', '2025-05-08 08:04:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164590001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '5/8/25: Kimber emailed back in not very happy with the decision. She said she called the dermatology office to ask if they could change the codes, but they said they can''t, that it wasn''t diagnostic, just an office visit. 

Replied with the following:
I’d recommend reaching out directly to Lori Niermeyer at ARM by calling 800-392-1770. She initially reviewed your bill and will be best equipped to give you clear answers.
While I’m here to help facilitate these types of concerns, the actual processing and decisions on claims are handled by Altrisk, so my ability to intervene is limited in this case.
However, I’d be happy to jump on a 3-way call if you need me to. 

Not sure what I could do for Kimber. She told me on the phone that the visit was a skin cancer check and absolutely nothing more -  but after reviewing the bill she sent in and asking her more questions, she then disclosed that they froze off a wart - which is clearly stated on the bill, and not paid for by the plan...

AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-08 07:33:40', '2025-05-08 07:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164586006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-08 07:23:45', '2025-05-08 07:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164586001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update membership to Premium HSA, address change &amp; IUA change eff 6/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-08 07:23:00', '2025-05-08 07:23:00'),
