  ('zcrm_1579374000164487051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', NULL, '06.07.25 MSEAP will reach out to Megan Keyser to let her know how to proceed forward with therapy. The provider she would like to use is not in network, so they will reach out to her to see if she would like to join the MSEAP network. If not, they will provide Megan with other options.  JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-05-07 13:10:37', '2025-05-07 13:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164505016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018002', 'Cathie Kovacs', NULL, '05/07/2025
Cathie called and asked me to call her provider to see if they take her network.
I called the number she gave me and they gave me the run around and said i need to call the actual doctors office since they would have the procedural codes and everything so i need to ask them if they accept PHCS. she called back and gave me the providers name she wants to see for me to look them up and try and see if we could avoid any out-of-pocket costs for Cathie. 
AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 13:06:49', '2025-05-07 14:43:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164489205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163663001', 'Doron Gordon', NULL, '5/7/25: Mirjam called in asking about her dental benefits, something about Spirit dental. Leo called her while we were on the phone. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 12:02:37', '2025-05-07 12:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164489200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154698002', 'Brady Schmitz', NULL, '5/7/25: Brady emailed in asking about chiropractic visits. 
Responded:
Hi Brady,
 
Here’s a quick screenshot from Zion’s guidelines on chiropractic treatments. They do share into chiropractic care if it’s part of a treatment plan tied to an eligible sharing request.
 
Since your IUA is $5,000, you’d need to meet that amount before sharing kicks in. So, if you’re just starting chiropractic care and haven’t already paid a substantial amount toward an eligible medical need, you’d be responsible for covering those visits out of pocket.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 12:01:19', '2025-05-07 12:01:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164489195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '5/7/25: Kimber emailed in asking about bill and cards. For some reason, cards never got sent but Dave assured me they''d go in the mail today. As for bill, I emailed update to Kimber on the 25th - forwarded the email. Her derm visit was not paid for in full bc it was not preventive. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 11:41:25', '2025-05-07 11:41:25'),
