  ('zcrm_1579374000164537051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '5-7-25 From 1Dental - brookeleclaire@gmail.com just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-07 11:13:51', '2025-05-07 11:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164537046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169157001', 'Shawn Aycock', NULL, '5-7-25 Wendy,
I wanted to give you an update on the status for myself and my partner Lisa McDonald.  We received information from you and discussed the Share Coverage Plan via Sedera, I believe.\

Last communication with you I indicated Lisa was having some changes to her employment status.  Well she was offered a "buy out" from her company as part of a separation package.  With this buy out we are able to stay on our current insurance unit September at no additional cost.  So, we opted to do that.  
What this means is that we will need to switch our insurance in August/September and would like to enroll in the shared plan we have discussed. 

Can you remind me, when we have to sign-up for this shared plan and when the coverage of the plan would start??

Bottom line, we still are planning on signing up for this shared healthcare plan and I wanted to give you an update so you don''t think we forgot about ya.

If  you have questions or need to discuss this further please feel free to call me.  970-420-1748.

--
Shawn Aycock

We will meet early Aug. to proceed. I''m suggesting Aug. 4th at noon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-07 11:13:10', '2025-05-07 11:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164489150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785001', 'Piotr Kaczmarowski', NULL, '5/7/25: Piotr called. He received 2 EOBs from colonoscopy stating that him and his wife still owed $477 dollars for each. Brought ARM into call and Lori confirmed that the colos were coded as screening but somehting was sent to pathology and still had screening codes. Lori is going to look into this further and appeal the original decision for member. Time is 12:09 CST if we need to go back and listen to call for details. Setting task for 20th, ARM checks are sent on 15th, give time to process through system. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 11:10:25', '2025-05-07 11:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164537040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-7-25 Ricki chose to move to Premium HSA for compliance and MEC. We changed from $500 IUA to $1000 IUA for June 1st. He also changed his address on the Change Form. We kept his kids on their plans since they are fine and Kyle is compliant for CA and Rhyan might have a small need with a weird mole on the bottom of her foot. He wants to keep the MEC for Rhyan as well, so she does her wellness visits. I saved Ricki about $300 a month which he''s thrilled about!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-07 11:09:18', '2025-05-07 11:09:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164537035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '5-7-25 Brooke also enrolled in 1Dental Careington 500 that includes Smiles ... something. She''s not tied to them but needs more general dentistry and has plenty of places to choose from. She will also use the vision discounts that are included. She''s paying $14.95 a month for the plan. She''s happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-07 11:06:49', '2025-05-07 11:06:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164537030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '5-7-25 We successfully got Brooke enrolled in Tax Time Enrollment. She received an email from C4 telling her it was time to enroll and she has 60 days. When we tried to enroll it still didn''t allow us to proceed. So, we had to call C4 and spoke with Samantha. She tried and had to get a team member to unlock her account to proceed. Ref # CAS-330678-S4P5M0. We were able to select the plan and Brooke submitted her initial and ongoing payment with Anthem. But, I told her not to trust that system and to follow up with Anthem to make the payment as well. 

Brooke LeClaire
