  ('zcrm_1579374000164489068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716704', 'Dawn Olson', NULL, 'Dawn called with questions regarding benefits. We discussed vendor change, and submitting diagnostic related bills to Zion, not MEC. She said she did, but it was not approved. She submitted a sharing request for TMJ - and is now needing an MRI for the issue. Mentioned she got an estimate from provider totaling around $4700.
Zion marked it unshareable and mentioned pending IUA. She was wondering if there''s anything she can do from here. I let her know, she can always appeal it. But it may just be pending IUA, and advised her to speak to Zion to gain clarity on why it''s not approved. Offered to do 3-way, but she wanted to call later. Also let Dawn know that if she thinks this decision was made in error, to let us know, and we can get involved.
Set task for 2 weeks to check in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 09:35:51', '2025-05-07 09:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164489063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018002', 'Cathie Kovacs', NULL, '5/7/25; Cathie called asking how to present to her provider bc they are not recognizing the MEC. I instructed her to present it as a self funded plan contracted with PHCS network and if provider says they don''t recognize, then we''d be happy to step in and chat with them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-07 09:31:43', '2025-05-07 09:31:43'),
