  ('zcrm_1579374000164297183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse from membership eff 6/25.  Due to divorce.  I will process.  Also address update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 09:45:51', '2025-05-02 09:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164279027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164303002', 'Douglas Sturgeon', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Care+. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2025-05-02 09:36:49', '2025-05-02 09:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164225134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-2-25 Rickie called bc he''s going to be spending more time in CA than CO soon and will file taxes in CA. He knows Sedera is no longer offering services in CA but he''ll still be in CO and AZ a significant amount of time. He wants to keep Sedera and I let him know he needs to add MEC for June 1st. We can also change his IUA from $500 to $1000 to bring down his costs. Right now he''s paying $1061.93 ES, $318.27 Kyle in CA, $318.27 for Rhyan in CO. We will need Rickie ES $720/$1000 and Kyle EO $313/$1000 to join Premium HSA and Rhyan to be auto enrolled into Premium Care $249/$1000. He''s also paying $165 HAB ES but hasn''t been submitting for reimbursement. He''s not good at managing his memberships. Any help I can provide will help him!  We will complete the conversion requests on Wed. next week to bring down his costs. Now costs will be about $1400 down from $1061.93 ES, $318.27 X 2 kids and $165 ES HAB. This is about $1850, so he''ll save about $450 every month June onward!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-02 09:35:35', '2025-05-02 09:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129828002', 'Emma Donovan', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 09:27:50', '2025-05-02 09:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129828002', 'Emma Donovan', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to switch to the Care + membership eff 6/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 09:25:53', '2025-05-02 09:25:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164292163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163486017', 'Victoria Habitzruther', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 09:22:22', '2025-05-02 09:22:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164281046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161465002', 'Christopher Hatala', NULL, '5/2/25: Lydia came through salesiq chat asking where to look on web to see if her chiropractor supports MPB Health. I let her know there are no network restrictions and that she can submit chiropractor bills for reimbursement if part of an eligible sharing request. Also asked if they have completed welcome call yet, which she said they would do this week. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 09:01:36', '2025-05-02 09:01:36'),
