  ('zcrm_1579374000164292150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163173002', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, 'Member canceled today the welcome call on booking calendar. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 08:36:56', '2025-05-02 08:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164292123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152900007', 'Joanne Gomez-Arnold', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code cards to Member at an address that she will be at the next 3 months for work. 1253 NW Cumberland Avenue, Bend, Oregon 97703. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 08:33:21', '2025-05-02 11:42:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164281028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161000002', 'James Vega', NULL, '5/2/25: Gastroenterology Specialists called to check network status. I checked their facility name, doctor names and NPI number for dr and nothing was coming up for me. Ended up connecting provider directly to ARM to verify. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 08:10:08', '2025-05-02 08:10:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164283103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157316001', 'Anthony Weiler', NULL, '5/1/25
Monica called wanting to know how get three of her incidents covered.
>Husband went to the ER(over $1500)
>Son had the flu so they went to the Dr office(under $1500)
>Monica went to the ER for a breast infection(under$1500)
I explained to her that only her husbands ER visit would be eligible for a sharing request after their IUA has been meet. Monica was under the impression that along has she had 4 isolated incidents the 4th one would be covered and should not need to pay anything out of pocket. I further explained that she need to have 3 qualifying medical needs( as in the actually met the $1500) before the 4th one could be free of any IUA expectation. Monica was visible upset and said that that was not what her advisor told her. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 08:03:25', '2025-05-02 08:03:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164281015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161060', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, '5/2/25: Lauren emailed in again saying that she uploaded a bunch of receipts to member portal and now they are not in there, plus that her husband''s surgery is on Monday. I suggested she call Zion as soon as she can today for an update and offered to jump on the call with her if need be. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 08:00:54', '2025-05-02 08:00:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120972020', 'Meagan Best', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 07:59:27', '2025-05-02 07:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120972020', 'Meagan Best', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change IUA from $5000 to $2500 eff 6/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 07:58:46', '2025-05-02 07:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164281010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357019', 'Brett Smagala', NULL, '5/2/25: Providers office called to check the eligibility of Kimberly. It was for labs - some preventive, some not. I asked if it was part of a wellness checkup. Let them know that Kim has a MEC that would pay for preventive ones, but may be balance billed for the others. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 07:56:00', '2025-05-02 07:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164281005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152324020', 'John Weller', NULL, '5/2/25: John called. He had an annual and then CT scan and has a followup with dr to read the results of the scan and wanted to make sure he approached the visit correctly. I advised him that unless the visit is coded preventive by his provider, he would pay cash for it. If it''s diagnostic then it would be considered part of the healthshare component of his plan - and in that case, to just collect an itemized statement, but he doesn''t need to submit anything unless he thinks it will go over his IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-02 07:50:42', '2025-05-02 07:50:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 07:47:36', '2025-05-02 07:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164297086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to drop the MEC eff 6/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-02 07:44:44', '2025-05-02 07:44:44');
