  ('zcrm_1579374000164238025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', NULL, '04.29.25 - Spoke to Meghan regarding her benefits and concerns for her mental health treatments. Advised to start using the healthwallet app for immediate assistance with psychiatric care as she stated that the in-person visits range at $1000.00. Sent her an email explaining the services as well as talk therapy options. Per advisor''s request, resending the email with MSEAP - she received confirmation that CA residence are eligible for 6 sessions. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-05-02 07:33:05', '2025-05-02 07:33:05'),
