  ('zcrm_1579374000164220185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '5-1-25 Quentin called bc my email was rejecting his. I see his emails. He also wanted to confirm that they are responsible for a recent Dr. visit for his girlfriend''s since she got a nasty virus. I let him know that they are responsible to pay and he''s fine with that. He''s very happy with the membership!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-01 16:57:47', '2025-05-01 16:57:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164294006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082414002', 'Trinity Bieker', NULL, 'She wanted me to make this note on the account. Called Borland groover back. Paul''s one of the reps, says they were able to reach the manager (Anna B.). They did authorize Self pay amount of $1200 for endoscopies that she is having on the 8th. - LM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-01 16:50:37', '2025-05-01 16:50:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164220180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161093011', 'Annique Sampson', NULL, '5-1-25 Per Patti, Annique will have to re-enroll when she''s ready to come back. 

"Whenever there is a gap in a membership, both Zion &amp; Sedera require a new application in order to have the member agree again to the principles."

I''ll let Annique know when she''s ready to roll again. I''ll waive the $100 Set-Up fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-01 16:35:34', '2025-05-01 16:35:34'),
