  ('zcrm_1579374000164220170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, '5-1-25 I spoke with both Hank and Xanthe separately. Hank signed up successfully for HAB EF $250 for a May 1st start date. I answered Xanthe''s questions about Care+ and clarified for wellness and maternity. I let her know about the maternity waiting period and $2500 IUA for maternity with the $1000 IUA. They currently have a 5 month old baby and I let her know Health Access will reimburse for the traditional well baby check-ups per the ACA. She will make sure she knows before they go in for those. She thinks the next one is a 6 month well check. They named their baby June as a simple, one syllable name since Xanthe''s name is confusring. It''s roots came from Chrysanthemum, the flower and she shortened it and changed the spelling and then went to just Xan in college. It''s a Greek name. We will talk on May 6th to enroll them into Care+ $1000/$672 EF for June 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-05-01 16:24:53', '2025-05-01 16:24:53'),
