  ('zcrm_1579374000164271178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089435002', 'Kangie Dawber', NULL, 'I called member back and she said that she had a receipt for her pmt.  I advised that her bank declined the pmt after that receipt was sent.  I told her that I was unable to take the pmt today and she would have to re-enroll.  That I tried to contact her 3 times via email and that her phone was disconnected.  She gave me a new number.  I will have Leo contact her to re-enroll.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-05-01 11:04:45', '2025-05-01 11:04:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164271163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209292', 'Brenda Kuehn', NULL, '5/1/25: Brenda called to make sure she was choosing correct network while looking up providers. PHCS Specific Services. There were no options near her for mammogram facilities. We tried searching "radiologoy" and found OregonSurgiCenter which she knows they do mamm - going to call and verify before she goes. We also discussed labs. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-01 10:58:21', '2025-05-01 10:58:21'),
