  ('zcrm_1579374000164271108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125340012', 'Wesley Burke', NULL, '5/1/25: Katie called back and let me know that her request is still showing pending due to needed contact info which she sent in yesterday. I let her know to just give it a few days, and I can touch base with her next week to see if it''s still going alright. She also asked about cataract surgery and why Zion would need a dr note for it. I explained that it''s prob bc of the guideline stipulations surrounding that specific issue and read her what it said - if procedures are 3 months apart, she would only pay 1 IUA - if further, then 2. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-05-01 08:28:01', '2025-05-01 08:28:01'),
