ANGELICA ZUNIGA"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-30 15:14:53', '2025-04-30 15:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164225081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, '4-30-25 Hank called bc wants to discuss new membership. He also sent this email, "Hi Wendy,

