  ('zcrm_1579374000164169014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, 'Called with questions regarding her pending need with Zion. Did let me know it was approved. She had submitted receipts on Saturday and was wondering why it showed she still hadn''t met her IUA. I let her know it may take a few days for that information to populate on her end. Let her know to check again tomorrow and we connect with Zion to see if there''s any issues.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-29 17:08:07', '2025-04-29 17:08:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164104159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '4-29-25 Mat is 39 and interested in adding his wife 35 and son, baby. But, his wife has sickle cell anemia and that caused serious problems in her recent pregnancy. So, I suggested that she finds out the cost of Cobra to protect her. I''ll also see if LifeX is an option for her or even the family. They live in PA, so Sedera is not an option.  He has the $1000 IUA and MC is $578 or MF $780 with Secure HSA which is what Mat has now. He knows the deadline for June 1st effective to add them by May 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 16:55:06', '2025-04-29 16:55:06'),
