  ('zcrm_1579374000164104139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '4-29-25 Patti wanted to check in about the email from Health Access to see if she needed to make any changes. I let her know she has the best membership and at the best price at the moment. Nothing is necessary to change. She was very appreciative and happy. All is well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 15:06:41', '2025-04-29 15:06:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164104134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164126022', 'Douglas MacLean', NULL, '4-28-25 Doug turned 49 on Feb. 14th. He lives in Greenwood Village, CO. He really doesn''t like his current ins. His kids mom has son on Medicaid and VA. He had son on his ins too which was causing more problems than helping. He''ll cancel his ins for them for May 31st. No health issues other than mildly high blood pressure which is well managed with meds and no hospital visits for that. No tobacco. He''s self-employed. Yesterday, he joined HAB with DPC for $124 and can get $70 reimbursed. Today he joined Premium Care $1500/$267 for June onward. He was referred by Jonna Grualich. He put her name on the app. He''s very happy to ditch his Cigna plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 15:03:20', '2025-04-29 15:03:20'),
