  ('zcrm_1579374000164104117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919695', 'Erinn Magin', NULL, '4-29-25 Erinn will be moving to upstate NY and will likely qualify for Medicaid. She''s expecting to earn about $12K as self-employed. I showed her how to access the cancellation form. She will be moving at the end of May and will be working for herself and her income is very unknown but she can''t afford her current membership. She''ll keep it until she get set up for Medicaid in NY.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 11:45:30', '2025-04-29 11:45:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164159027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919695', 'Erinn Magin', NULL, '4/29/25: Erinn called, saying she was moving out of state and wanted to know if her plan was good outside of CO - yes, let her know it''s fine in NY. She also said she''s going to have very little income once she moves and wondering what her options are. Let her know the best person to speak to would be her advisor Wendy - provided number and transferred. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-29 11:38:49', '2025-04-29 11:38:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000164104109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165371', 'Beth Erlander', NULL, '4-29-25 Beth is choosing to move to Premium Care for June 1st and joining HAB for May 1st. She wants to get her meds priced out from MPB Concierge. She just is dealing with menopause and mildly off on thyroid that she takes all natural meds from Thailand called Thyroid S or SPS. She''s able to source them super affordably. But her progesterone meds she''s paying too much, about $40 I think she said. I see them for $3.85 on GoodRX but didn''t check all of the other sites. It should definitely be more affordable.  Send her the Premium Care Handbook after see converts tomorrow! She forgot all of the benefits that are included in her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 11:33:37', '2025-04-29 11:34:36'),
