  ('zcrm_1579374000163927089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '4/25/25


Karen called with questions regarding how her plan works. I explained that the ARM card will only cover services under ACA preventive guidelines, and that Zion will share in larger medical expenses.
Karen had questions about how to proceed with a significant medical expense for her child related to a heart condition (specifically a $7,000 echocardiogram). To provide more clarity, we initiated a three-way call with a Zion representative, who gave a detailed explanation of the sharing request process.
Karen also expressed concern over a high lab bill she received. Upon further discussion, she shared that she herself is currently unwell, has seen multiple providers, and is unsure of her diagnosis. I advised her to open a separate sharing request for her own medical needs.
Additionally, I informed her that we have an extensive formulary available for her medications and encouraged her to review it for any cost-saving opportunities.
